02:18:37,910 --> 02:18:41,570
And when you, like, break the lights in the back... Oh, wow.

2668
02:18:43,250 --> 02:18:43,610
Incredible.

2669
02:18:44,890 --> 02:18:46,190
Also, I'm a ghost driver right now.

2670
02:18:46,210 --> 02:18:46,670
What am I doing?

2671
02:18:46,990 --> 02:18:48,430
Get on the right side of the road, you idiot.

2672
02:18:49,290 --> 02:18:49,650
Sorry.

2673
02:18:50,850 --> 02:18:51,210
Sorry.

2674
02:18:52,630 --> 02:18:54,450
I gotta keep a low profile here, at least.

2675
02:19:00,600 --> 02:19:01,700
Let's get on this side.

2676
02:19:06,860 --> 02:19:07,760
Speed limit 60.

2677
02:19:07,840 --> 02:19:08,760
I wish I could see my speed.

2678
02:19:09,200 --> 02:19:10,900
I want to uphold the laws here.

2679
02:19:11,880 --> 02:19:12,240
Turn left.

2680
02:19:12,420 --> 02:19:14,240
Okay, so I get a... Oh, I got to get on that lane.

2681
02:19:14,260 --> 02:19:14,680
That makes sense.

2682
02:19:14,780 --> 02:19:16,660
There's like a little arrow pointing left as well.

2683
02:19:17,520 --> 02:19:18,940
Sorry, I'm going to stay right here.

2684
02:19:20,460 --> 02:19:21,480
I'm going to wait for this guy.

2685
02:19:22,360 --> 02:19:22,540
Go.

2686
02:19:25,060 --> 02:19:25,380
Whoa!

2687
02:19:26,200 --> 02:19:27,180
That was not on me.

2688
02:19:27,480 --> 02:19:28,200
Did you see that guy?

2689
02:19:28,880 --> 02:19:30,040
Why was he driving left?

2690
02:19:31,200 --> 02:19:31,520
Bastard.

2691
02:19:32,220 --> 02:19:33,680
I'm trying to uphold the laws here.

2692
02:19:34,160 --> 02:19:35,980
Like an upstanding citizen, I say.

2693
02:19:36,600 --> 02:19:38,260
While running through a red light, but, you know.

2694
02:19:40,300 --> 02:19:42,160
I do have the cops on me, I gotta be careful.

2695
02:19:49,960 --> 02:19:51,120
Pay and spray, let's go.

2696
02:19:51,880 --> 02:19:54,460
God, man, this game is so good looking.

2697
02:19:55,100 --> 02:19:57,280
It's actually almost painfully good looking.

2698
02:19:58,400 --> 02:19:59,840
How am I gonna go back to other games?

2699
02:20:03,290 --> 02:20:04,070
Repair the Phoenix.

2700
02:20:04,210 --> 02:20:05,990
Yeah, this thing has seen better days, let's say that.

2701
02:20:06,990 --> 02:20:08,710
That's gonna come out of my paycheck, isn't it?

2702
02:20:11,230 --> 02:20:12,130
How much was that?

2703
02:20:14,090 --> 02:20:16,230
I have 200 left, so it wasn't that bad.

2704
02:20:19,940 --> 02:20:20,500
Ah.

2705
02:20:21,780 --> 02:20:22,340
Okay.

2706
02:20:23,960 --> 02:20:24,520
Respray?

2707
02:20:24,620 --> 02:20:25,460
Yeah, let's respray it.

2708
02:20:27,980 --> 02:20:29,340
Fuck those flames.

2709
02:20:29,500 --> 02:20:30,100
That looks horrible.

2710
02:20:32,140 --> 02:20:34,800
Let's go for... gray.

2711
02:20:37,080 --> 02:20:38,740
Not the best look, but you know.

2712
02:20:40,220 --> 02:20:40,780
Okay.

2713
02:20:41,260 --> 02:20:46,320
Cops will recognize you're faster in areas with heat if you haven't changed your appearance and clothing.

2714
02:20:47,350 --> 02:20:48,410
Oh, appearance!

2715
02:20:48,770 --> 02:20:53,330
As in, like, what hat I'm wearing or, like, what my beard looks like?

2716
02:20:53,610 --> 02:20:55,090
What glasses I'm wearing, I guess?

2717
02:21:03,810 --> 02:21:06,270
Man... That's sick.

2718
02:21:07,330 --> 02:21:07,790
Woof!

2719
02:21:09,890 --> 02:21:11,330
I'm getting chills, man.

2720
02:21:16,110 --> 02:21:17,510
Fun has no borders.

2721
02:21:21,090 --> 02:21:21,650
Lavazza.

2722
02:21:22,610 --> 02:21:24,330
Oh, it's like a beer ad or something?

2723
02:21:24,930 --> 02:21:25,630
Car wash?

2724
02:21:26,830 --> 02:21:28,030
There's no way that works.

2725
02:21:29,990 --> 02:21:31,570
Free tire fill.

2726
02:21:36,310 --> 02:21:38,770
Wash my car, or maybe it's closed this hour.

2727
02:21:47,810 --> 02:21:48,490
Okay, you know what?

2728
02:21:48,510 --> 02:21:53,250
I was gonna actually try to punch her a little bit, but we're still doing a mission here.

2729
02:21:55,470 --> 02:21:57,510
I just wanna see how she would react to that, you know?

2730
02:21:58,110 --> 02:21:59,630
But I'm not gonna fuck up the mission now.

2731
02:22:00,310 --> 02:22:01,370
Let's lock in.

2732
02:22:04,330 --> 02:22:05,530
I wanted to punch her a little bit.

2733
02:22:11,960 --> 02:22:16,000
I like the little turn left in so many feet.

2734
02:22:16,940 --> 02:22:18,560
Who uses feet?

2735
02:22:22,700 --> 02:22:23,960
That's crazy.

2736
02:22:34,120 --> 02:22:39,700
I love the way the signs on the road also light up when your headlights are shining on them.

2737
02:22:40,700 --> 02:22:41,980
It's a very cool detail.

2738
02:22:45,160 --> 02:22:46,060
Damn, dude.

2739
02:22:47,420 --> 02:22:48,600
I want to be let loose.

2740
02:22:56,320 --> 02:22:57,740
Oh, whoop, whoop, whoop, whoop, whoop, whoop.

2741
02:22:57,800 --> 02:22:59,240
We just got this car repaired.

2742
02:22:59,760 --> 02:23:00,700
I'm going to drive this carefully.

2743
02:23:00,860 --> 02:23:01,520
Whoops, missed it.

2744
02:23:06,750 --> 02:23:07,810
What's going on here?

2745
02:23:08,710 --> 02:23:09,530
Big shots.

2746
02:23:09,730 --> 02:23:10,830
Wholesale weapons and ammo.

2747
02:23:17,010 --> 02:23:18,150
What was that sound?

2748
02:23:18,550 --> 02:23:20,010
Oh, it's the lights turning on.

2749
02:23:25,190 --> 02:23:26,130
There we go.

2750
02:23:26,310 --> 02:23:27,570
Look at that smooth driving.

2751
02:23:28,950 --> 02:23:30,570
Left the phoenix at your place.

2752
02:23:31,830 --> 02:23:32,270
XOXO.

2753
02:23:32,950 --> 02:23:34,430
Okay, there's some cash in the bag.

2754
02:23:34,590 --> 02:23:35,530
You can take it for your trouble.

2755
02:23:36,650 --> 02:23:41,150
And you should go to a store or something to get a change of clothes so the cops aren't all over you.

2756
02:23:41,910 --> 02:23:42,910
That's very wise.

2757
02:23:43,790 --> 02:23:45,010
Let's go do that right now.

2758
02:23:46,990 --> 02:23:47,590
Wait a minute.

2759
02:23:47,830 --> 02:23:50,010
So the cops also recognize my weapons or what?

2760
02:23:52,590 --> 02:23:53,170
What's that?

2761
02:23:53,550 --> 02:23:54,530
Ah, yeah, cash.

2762
02:23:55,070 --> 02:23:55,910
Thank you.

2763
02:23:57,330 --> 02:23:58,310
Open loadout.

2764
02:23:58,730 --> 02:24:00,950
Press R1 to access items.

2765
02:24:02,350 --> 02:24:04,710
And just your hat and glasses to lower recognition.

2766
02:24:05,430 --> 02:24:07,330
Oh, we can do that right now.

2767
02:24:08,330 --> 02:24:09,490
Put that on.

2768
02:24:10,270 --> 02:24:11,370
Take that off.

2769
02:24:12,390 --> 02:24:13,210
Current outfits.

2770
02:24:14,150 --> 02:24:17,550
Ah, so you want to store outfits in your car, I guess.

2771
02:24:18,970 --> 02:24:19,910
That's neat.

2772
02:24:20,470 --> 02:24:21,330
What's that?

2773
02:24:22,470 --> 02:24:24,570
First aid kit, very helpful.

2774
02:24:26,670 --> 02:24:31,430
Use the adrenaline from your loadout to overpower your health, stamina, and focus for a short time.

2775
02:24:32,430 --> 02:24:32,730
Okay.

2776
02:24:34,610 --> 02:24:35,630
Is that a water cooler?

2777
02:24:37,030 --> 02:24:39,650
Changing your accessories or hairstyle will make you harder to recognize.

2778
02:24:40,890 --> 02:24:42,330
Oh my god, that looks so good.

2779
02:24:43,390 --> 02:24:44,990
Did you see the bubbles right then?

2780
02:24:48,480 --> 02:24:52,560
Yeah, better drink up, Jason, after that disaster of a job.

2781
02:24:52,840 --> 02:24:56,280
That was painfully embarrassing.

2782
02:25:00,120 --> 02:25:01,760
I'm gonna stress test the game right now.

2783
02:25:02,640 --> 02:25:03,920
I'm gonna put it on the chair.

2784
02:25:06,340 --> 02:25:07,180
Okay, okay.

2785
02:25:08,280 --> 02:25:09,340
I guess it couldn't know.

2786
02:25:09,580 --> 02:25:10,000
Cigarettes?

2787
02:25:12,260 --> 02:25:13,020
I smoke?

2788
02:25:14,140 --> 02:25:14,820
Wait a minute.

2789
02:25:17,260 --> 02:25:17,900
No way.

2790
02:25:20,980 --> 02:25:21,400
What?

2791
02:25:26,300 --> 02:25:27,700
I mean, that's bad for my health.

2792
02:25:31,110 --> 02:25:32,030
Well, you know what?

2793
02:25:32,290 --> 02:25:34,350
If it looks stupid but works, it ain't stupid.

2794
02:25:34,530 --> 02:25:35,710
We got the job done, didn't we?

2795
02:25:40,450 --> 02:25:41,790
And nobody does it like me.

2796
02:25:43,950 --> 02:25:50,210
I mean, you can say anything you want, but that was a display of manliness.

2797
02:25:55,230 --> 02:25:55,630
Yep.

2798
02:25:56,750 --> 02:25:57,150
Beautiful.

2799
02:25:58,010 --> 02:25:58,930
Alright, let's get out of here.

2800
02:26:01,920 --> 02:26:03,280
Don't want to make it too easy, you know?

2801
02:26:06,600 --> 02:26:07,420
Can I steal that?

2802
02:26:08,560 --> 02:26:09,340
Maybe I shouldn't.

2803
02:26:09,880 --> 02:26:10,960
Low profile and all that.

2804
02:26:13,720 --> 02:26:14,300
What's up, guys?

2805
02:26:18,070 --> 02:26:19,150
Am I intruding?

2806
02:26:19,850 --> 02:26:20,870
What's going on?

2807
02:26:26,290 --> 02:26:27,150
Oh yeah?

2808
02:26:33,030 --> 02:26:34,670
Whoa, whoa, whoa!

2809
02:26:38,510 --> 02:26:39,590
Oh my god!

2810
02:26:41,710 --> 02:26:43,190
Can I knife their tires?

2811
02:26:44,430 --> 02:26:45,490
Where's my knife?

2812
02:26:47,420 --> 02:26:48,600
I may have gotten rid of the knife.

2813
02:26:49,880 --> 02:26:51,200
I really wanted to slice their tires.

2814
02:26:59,840 --> 02:27:00,160
Oh!

2815
02:27:00,300 --> 02:27:01,300
I clicked on the shoot button!

2816
02:27:01,380 --> 02:27:01,780
It didn't shoot!

2817
02:27:02,060 --> 02:27:02,920
Is the safety on?

2818
02:27:04,000 --> 02:27:04,940
I swear to god I clicked.

2819
02:27:06,260 --> 02:27:06,960
I don't know what's happening.

2820
02:27:10,950 --> 02:27:11,830
Let me go in here.

2821
02:27:13,390 --> 02:27:14,270
Buy an outfit.

2822
02:27:15,030 --> 02:27:15,950
Okay, okay, okay.

2823
02:27:16,990 --> 02:27:18,170
Ew, I hate this floor.

2824
02:27:19,410 --> 02:27:19,770
Ugh.

2825
02:27:20,570 --> 02:27:20,770
Ugh.

2826
02:27:21,950 --> 02:27:23,130
Big shots work wear.

2827
02:27:25,010 --> 02:27:27,350
Uh, I mean... Yeah.

2828
02:27:28,150 --> 02:27:29,490
Interlant tea and cargos.

2829
02:27:29,990 --> 02:27:31,470
Will remove outfit heat.

2830
02:27:33,270 --> 02:27:34,410
Let me see what else they got.

2831
02:27:35,470 --> 02:27:36,950
I don't want to look like an army dude.

2832
02:27:37,190 --> 02:27:37,530
No.

2833
02:27:38,390 --> 02:27:40,390
Wearing tactical gear in public is cringe.

2834
02:27:42,470 --> 02:27:48,750
Camo is fine, because it's like a, you know, style, I guess, but... Is that a locker?

2835
02:27:48,910 --> 02:27:49,570
Ooh, wait a minute.

2836
02:27:51,750 --> 02:27:54,650
I thought they would have valuables in there, but it's probably just for sale.

2837
02:27:56,810 --> 02:27:58,650
Okay, I'm gonna buy this outfit then.

2838
02:27:59,410 --> 02:28:00,990
Can I buy a tank top while I'm at it?

2839
02:28:03,730 --> 02:28:04,350
I'll take it.

2840
02:28:07,060 --> 02:28:07,420
Nice.

2841
02:28:07,420 --> 02:28:09,580
So now they only recognize my gun, it seems.

2842
02:28:10,520 --> 02:28:13,340
If recognition is cleared, cops can't ID you.

2843
02:28:14,800 --> 02:28:16,320
Okay, so it's cleared right now.

2844
02:28:17,720 --> 02:28:21,460
I mean, they know that... or they know what I look like.

2845
02:28:22,260 --> 02:28:23,700
But now I've changed my appearance.

2846
02:28:24,800 --> 02:28:27,500
But they're still looking for a guy with a shotgun, but I could be anybody, right?

2847
02:28:30,300 --> 02:28:32,460
Uh, no, I'm good.

2848
02:28:36,160 --> 02:28:36,760
Thanks.

2849
02:28:36,760 --> 02:28:38,460
I killed three people today.

2850
02:28:38,740 --> 02:28:39,680
With a shotgun.

2851
02:28:40,320 --> 02:28:40,760
That's right.

2852
02:28:45,960 --> 02:28:47,320
Uh, nah.

2853
02:28:52,940 --> 02:28:53,540
Alright.

2854
02:28:54,280 --> 02:28:55,220
I'll see you later.

2855
02:28:55,280 --> 02:28:55,840
What's that, view?

2856
02:28:57,860 --> 02:28:59,260
Duke 1922.

2857
02:29:00,220 --> 02:29:01,660
What about a 1911?

2858
02:29:02,160 --> 02:29:03,220
That's the gun for me.

2859
02:29:04,640 --> 02:29:05,440
Get out of the way.

2860
02:29:07,140 --> 02:29:08,480
Okay, let's go home, shall we?

2861
02:29:09,800 --> 02:29:11,440
But my car isn't here.

2862
02:29:14,100 --> 02:29:14,540
Huh?

2863
02:29:16,560 --> 02:29:18,960
Oh, is that the mission successful sound?

2864
02:29:19,620 --> 02:29:20,880
Heat will eventually die down.

2865
02:29:21,080 --> 02:29:22,920
Use the map to see areas where you will have heat.

2866
02:29:25,600 --> 02:29:26,360
Oh, okay.

2867
02:29:26,940 --> 02:29:28,260
Wait, that's actually so cool.

2868
02:29:29,340 --> 02:29:29,780
So...

2869
02:29:30,660 --> 02:29:36,380
I'm not out of the woods just yet, because there's... Oh, visible weapon.

2870
02:29:38,180 --> 02:29:39,400
I see how it is.

2871
02:29:40,420 --> 02:29:42,920
Okay, so we just gotta not have that on our back, I guess.

2872
02:29:43,000 --> 02:29:44,040
I guess that is kind of suspicious.

2873
02:29:44,520 --> 02:29:48,060
Like, why is a guy running around with a shotgun on his back in the night?

2874
02:29:49,440 --> 02:29:49,800
Oh!

2875
02:29:51,060 --> 02:29:51,420
Cal?

2876
02:29:52,100 --> 02:29:53,000
Money in your mailbox.

2877
02:29:53,240 --> 02:29:54,300
You bailed me out again, bro.

2878
02:29:54,680 --> 02:29:55,300
You got away, right?

2879
02:29:55,620 --> 02:29:56,360
Tell me you got away.

2880
02:29:56,560 --> 02:29:56,960
Let me know.

2881
02:29:57,330 --> 02:29:57,810
I'm good.

2882
02:29:57,970 --> 02:29:58,670
Thanks for the cash.

2883
02:30:00,250 --> 02:30:01,210
Man, a few words.

2884
02:30:02,990 --> 02:30:03,530
There you go.

2885
02:30:05,750 --> 02:30:08,250
Did it say you can call a taxi or something just now?

2886
02:30:09,790 --> 02:30:10,510
I love Kel.

2887
02:30:13,910 --> 02:30:14,450
So wait.

2888
02:30:15,170 --> 02:30:15,530
Taxi.

2889
02:30:15,710 --> 02:30:16,910
I guess that would be phone.

2890
02:30:19,390 --> 02:30:19,750
Taxi.

2891
02:30:21,990 --> 02:30:22,350
News.

2892
02:30:23,090 --> 02:30:24,770
I guess we can read the news at some point.

2893
02:30:25,360 --> 02:30:26,140
Wank.

2894
02:30:26,900 --> 02:30:28,520
It's probably in context.

2895
02:30:29,000 --> 02:30:30,900
Paradise Taxi.

2896
02:30:31,520 --> 02:30:32,300
Call him.

2897
02:30:40,325 --> 02:30:42,925
Hi, you've reached Paradise Taxi. Looking for a ride?

2898
02:30:43,225 --> 02:30:44,858
Yeah, hey. Can I order a car?

2899
02:30:45,025 --> 02:30:48,892
A taxi will be at your location in a moment.

2900
02:30:50,300 --> 02:30:50,920
Thank you.

2901
02:30:52,580 --> 02:30:54,360
I hope I get to actually see the whole ride.

2902
02:30:55,460 --> 02:30:56,640
Oh, that was fast.

2903
02:30:56,880 --> 02:30:58,040
I guess they had one in the area.

2904
02:31:01,270 --> 02:31:02,250
Uh, yeah, thanks.

2905
02:31:02,970 --> 02:31:08,030
I was afraid he was gonna pull him out of the car.

2906
02:31:10,190 --> 02:31:12,230
Oh, where are we going?

2907
02:31:12,490 --> 02:31:13,570
I guess we're going home.

2908
02:31:14,990 --> 02:31:16,730
And home is all the way back here, isn't it?

2909
02:31:17,690 --> 02:31:18,790
We got money in the mailbox.

2910
02:31:20,250 --> 02:31:21,690
Collect Brian's rent.

2911
02:31:23,150 --> 02:31:24,090
Visit the boutique.

2912
02:31:24,170 --> 02:31:24,470
Oh, yeah.

2913
02:31:24,710 --> 02:31:25,530
We didn't do that yet.

2914
02:31:26,570 --> 02:31:27,850
I guess I got a little distracted.

2915
02:31:28,520 --> 02:31:29,760
With the other mission.

2916
02:31:30,460 --> 02:31:31,400
Is that my home?

2917
02:31:34,800 --> 02:31:35,520
Jason's house.

2918
02:31:36,080 --> 02:31:39,160
Small house on loan from Brian in return for helping with his business.

2919
02:31:39,960 --> 02:31:42,800
Okay, so we can fix steps, railing, paint the wall.

2920
02:31:43,780 --> 02:31:44,300
Alright.

2921
02:31:44,660 --> 02:31:46,000
I mean, let's do that tomorrow.

2922
02:31:47,280 --> 02:31:48,400
Let's go home first.

2923
02:31:49,800 --> 02:31:50,720
78 bucks.

2924
02:31:51,820 --> 02:31:52,340
Alright.

2925
02:31:52,540 --> 02:31:52,840
Thanks.

2926
02:32:02,975 --> 02:32:04,142
So how's things?

2927
02:32:16,850 --> 02:32:19,310
Think you don't want to hear from your taxi driver.

2928
02:32:20,010 --> 02:32:20,650
For sure.

2929
02:32:21,130 --> 02:32:22,150
Can I look at my phone?

2930
02:32:22,810 --> 02:32:24,230
Oh, yo!

2931
02:32:26,480 --> 02:32:27,660
Let's take a picture of him.

2932
02:32:28,360 --> 02:32:29,780
Oh, I can't do that?

2933
02:32:30,040 --> 02:32:31,920
I was going to document my little journey here.

2934
02:32:33,380 --> 02:32:36,600
