03:11:43,900 --> 03:11:46,040
Maybe we can combine those two in one.

3471
03:11:47,300 --> 03:11:48,640
Nifty threats, island wear.

3472
03:11:49,380 --> 03:11:52,300
Vintage store selling clothing, footwear, and accessories at a bargain.

3473
03:11:53,420 --> 03:11:54,480
You know what I want to do?

3474
03:11:54,980 --> 03:11:57,360
I want to try and make an outfit here we can change later.

3475
03:12:00,740 --> 03:12:01,980
Save found headwear?

3476
03:12:02,760 --> 03:12:05,160
You have some found headwear which can be lost.

3477
03:12:05,760 --> 03:12:07,340
Save it to your wardrobe to keep it.

3478
03:12:07,500 --> 03:12:08,160
Oh, yes.

3479
03:12:09,080 --> 03:12:11,260
Wait, is that the hat I stole from the guy I shot?

3480
03:12:12,480 --> 03:12:13,300
I think it is.

3481
03:12:15,300 --> 03:12:17,640
Let's, um... Oh, add to trunk?

3482
03:12:19,160 --> 03:12:20,700
So now we have a whole outfit in the trunk.

3483
03:12:20,820 --> 03:12:22,300
Oh, we have two outfits in the trunk.

3484
03:12:22,360 --> 03:12:24,100
This one and that one.

3485
03:12:28,130 --> 03:12:28,570
Nice.

3486
03:12:28,570 --> 03:12:34,010
I feel like a swimwear outfit could be nice and handy to have in the trunk.

3487
03:12:36,970 --> 03:12:38,130
Just underwear is weird.

3488
03:12:38,270 --> 03:12:38,790
We don't want that.

3489
03:12:40,970 --> 03:12:42,250
Yeah, that's good enough for now.

3490
03:12:44,410 --> 03:12:44,850
Great.

3491
03:12:46,590 --> 03:12:49,470
Put on stored outfits in the loadout section of your trunk.

3492
03:12:49,590 --> 03:12:50,190
Let's go try that.

3493
03:12:52,250 --> 03:12:53,850
I want to see how that interaction works.

3494
03:12:58,670 --> 03:13:00,710
Finish the workout to lock in your gains.

3495
03:13:01,850 --> 03:13:02,350
Nah.

3496
03:13:04,710 --> 03:13:05,870
I'm too lazy, man.

3497
03:13:06,490 --> 03:13:07,670
It's just like real life.

3498
03:13:09,170 --> 03:13:11,070
Maybe I'll try the basketball thing again.

3499
03:13:12,650 --> 03:13:15,650
This time... Oh, wait.

3500
03:13:15,790 --> 03:13:16,870
Maybe we should not wear this.

3501
03:13:17,690 --> 03:13:22,190
I guess he automatically takes that off when... Wait, where's my car?

3502
03:13:26,900 --> 03:13:32,240
Wait a second, I left my car at that spot where Cal was fishing.

3503
03:13:32,700 --> 03:13:34,180
Is it still there?

3504
03:13:39,460 --> 03:13:40,980
Oh my god!

3505
03:13:46,040 --> 03:13:48,900
Well, I'm in the mood for a walk, I guess.

3506
03:13:49,600 --> 03:13:50,520
I don't mind that.

3507
03:13:50,700 --> 03:13:51,820
We can take care of the house later.

3508
03:13:52,920 --> 03:13:53,760
Let me unequip that.

3509
03:13:54,880 --> 03:13:57,000
Can I not store my guns in the house or something?

3510
03:13:58,280 --> 03:13:59,900
I don't want to be walking around with that.

3511
03:14:03,220 --> 03:14:04,080
Let me see here.

3512
03:14:05,400 --> 03:14:07,320
Or maybe I've got to find one of those lockers.

3513
03:14:13,520 --> 03:14:15,140
Oh, it's actually kind of nice that you can do this.

3514
03:14:18,180 --> 03:14:18,500
Okay.

3515
03:14:20,740 --> 03:14:22,220
Alright, guess we're gonna go for a walk.

3516
03:14:22,660 --> 03:14:24,540
Or I can take the jet ski here.

3517
03:14:25,380 --> 03:14:26,360
I wonder if that actually... Oh!

3518
03:14:26,700 --> 03:14:27,880
I can look behind me like that.

3519
03:14:28,440 --> 03:14:28,940
That's neat.

3520
03:14:30,000 --> 03:14:30,800
Let me see if this works.

3521
03:14:32,980 --> 03:14:34,120
Can I take it out for a spin?

3522
03:14:35,240 --> 03:14:36,780
Okay, I'll finish the workout, dammit.

3523
03:14:38,140 --> 03:14:39,740
Let's try and see if we can get up behind here.

3524
03:14:43,520 --> 03:14:46,660
That would be... back here.

3525
03:14:47,240 --> 03:14:51,420
I guess we can do some... whatever this is called.

3526
03:14:52,140 --> 03:14:52,940
Deadlifts.

3527
03:14:53,380 --> 03:14:54,780
Why is it called deadlift?

3528
03:14:55,180 --> 03:14:56,060
Sounds scary.

3529
03:14:56,980 --> 03:14:57,960
160 kilos.

3530
03:14:58,800 --> 03:15:00,100
Dude, that's a lot.

3531
03:15:04,260 --> 03:15:06,320
Why wouldn't I take the highest one?

3532
03:15:07,920 --> 03:15:08,600
Come on!

3533
03:15:09,460 --> 03:15:12,400
Hold them to lift the bar and gradually release to lower.

3534
03:15:12,560 --> 03:15:12,700
Okay.

3535
03:15:17,060 --> 03:15:18,020
Oh, sweet.

3536
03:15:19,220 --> 03:15:19,660
Yep.

3537
03:15:20,860 --> 03:15:22,600
And... Oh, that was a bit too fast.

3538
03:15:23,280 --> 03:15:24,320
What if I just let go?

3539
03:15:25,880 --> 03:15:27,380
Okay, I guess that's not good for you.

3540
03:15:28,020 --> 03:15:28,880
Or the back.

3541
03:15:30,320 --> 03:15:32,180
Oh, you can see he's getting tired.

3542
03:15:37,400 --> 03:15:39,980
And there we go.

3543
03:15:40,900 --> 03:15:43,460
Yeah, plus 11%.

3544
03:15:43,460 --> 03:15:46,240
Let's do bench press.

3545
03:15:50,500 --> 03:15:53,640
Why would I do 80 or 60 when I can do 100?

3546
03:15:56,220 --> 03:15:56,960
Do 100.

3547
03:15:59,160 --> 03:16:00,960
And... I guess we pull them down.

3548
03:16:01,480 --> 03:16:01,960
Oh!

3549
03:16:02,360 --> 03:16:02,840
Jesus!

3550
03:16:03,260 --> 03:16:05,380
Don't get... hurt here.

3551
03:16:06,500 --> 03:16:06,980
Down.

3552
03:16:07,260 --> 03:16:07,840
Hold it.

3553
03:16:08,180 --> 03:16:08,820
And up.

3554
03:16:11,980 --> 03:16:13,560
Dude, I'm not even gonna lie.

3555
03:16:13,760 --> 03:16:16,160
It's actually kind of exhausting to hold these buttons down.

3556
03:16:16,540 --> 03:16:18,020
This is a workout for me.

3557
03:16:22,000 --> 03:16:22,620
Come on.

3558
03:16:23,660 --> 03:16:24,060
Up.

3559
03:16:25,420 --> 03:16:29,760
Like, I am pressing these buttons down with so much force, it's probably not good for the controller.

3560
03:16:31,560 --> 03:16:36,880
Oh my god, I can feel his... pain through the controller here.

3561
03:16:37,680 --> 03:16:38,620
Did I finish it?

3562
03:16:40,600 --> 03:16:41,660
Oh, I didn't finish these.

3563
03:16:43,960 --> 03:16:45,420
Okay, let's really get this done then.

3564
03:16:46,680 --> 03:16:47,080
Yep.

3565
03:16:49,230 --> 03:16:50,790
Oh, do I have to, like, swing him?

3566
03:16:52,670 --> 03:16:52,990
Wee.

3567
03:16:54,210 --> 03:16:54,530
Wee.

3568
03:16:55,710 --> 03:16:56,690
Oh, look at his rhythm.

3569
03:16:57,870 --> 03:16:58,790
Look at the way I'm doing it.

3570
03:16:59,230 --> 03:17:00,090
Is he sweating?

3571
03:17:02,850 --> 03:17:04,310
Oh, set failed?

3572
03:17:05,370 --> 03:17:06,650
I guess I had bad form.

3573
03:17:07,250 --> 03:17:07,750
Let me try again.

3574
03:17:09,370 --> 03:17:09,930
Come on, man.

3575
03:17:10,870 --> 03:17:12,950
I can't even work out correctly in a video game.

3576
03:17:13,230 --> 03:17:14,430
That's when you know things are bad.

3577
03:17:23,650 --> 03:17:24,070
No!

3578
03:17:24,070 --> 03:17:25,590
Wait, why is he so bad at this?

3579
03:17:26,090 --> 03:17:28,310
Oh, wait a minute, I don't have any stamina right now.

3580
03:17:29,230 --> 03:17:31,570
Maybe that's why I need to use a smaller weight.

3581
03:17:33,070 --> 03:17:34,470
I'm not strong enough for this.

3582
03:17:34,970 --> 03:17:36,330
Let me wait for this to regen.

3583
03:17:38,150 --> 03:17:38,910
There we go.

3584
03:17:39,330 --> 03:17:40,470
Let's use the smaller one.

3585
03:17:43,610 --> 03:17:44,030
Yeah.

3586
03:17:48,380 --> 03:17:48,780
Faster.

3587
03:17:52,180 --> 03:17:53,240
Oh, look at that.

3588
03:17:54,560 --> 03:17:55,660
No, I messed it up.

3589
03:17:59,580 --> 03:18:02,480
Oh, we need to do 14 reps because it's a smaller weight.

3590
03:18:05,480 --> 03:18:06,780
Dude, this looks so exhausting.

3591
03:18:06,960 --> 03:18:07,520
Jesus Christ.

3592
03:18:10,020 --> 03:18:11,020
Put it down, man.

3593
03:18:12,980 --> 03:18:13,380
Okay.

3594
03:18:13,940 --> 03:18:14,820
You need time to recover.

3595
03:18:15,680 --> 03:18:16,540
Damn right I do.

3596
03:18:17,260 --> 03:18:19,080
I feel like I need another shower after that one.

3597
03:18:20,860 --> 03:18:22,340
Dude, you can see he's sweating.

3598
03:18:23,120 --> 03:18:24,680
That detail, though, is crazy.

3599
03:18:27,600 --> 03:18:28,140
Close it.

3600
03:18:31,920 --> 03:18:32,860
What's that sound?

3601
03:18:34,980 --> 03:18:36,080
Is that a coffee machine?

3602
03:18:40,090 --> 03:18:42,990
Dude, it's just ready for me at all times.

3603
03:18:43,370 --> 03:18:43,970
That's amazing.

3604
03:18:45,110 --> 03:18:46,810
Definitely need a water after that one.

3605
03:18:49,670 --> 03:18:51,070
Dude, protein shake, right?

3606
03:18:51,190 --> 03:18:52,870
Isn't that what you use when you work out?

3607
03:18:53,910 --> 03:18:55,170
Let's protein it up, man.

3608
03:18:56,270 --> 03:18:56,750
Oh, yeah.

3609
03:18:56,890 --> 03:18:58,230
This is what people do.

3610
03:19:00,050 --> 03:19:02,910
I feel like I get to see a part of life I never experienced here.

3611
03:19:04,530 --> 03:19:06,310
This is what all those guys are doing out there.

3612
03:19:07,850 --> 03:19:12,950
And then they walk around like this, you know, they're like, oh yeah, I feel so good right now because I worked out.

3613
03:19:13,190 --> 03:19:14,010
Let me drink some more.

3614
03:19:15,330 --> 03:19:16,250
There you go.

3615
03:19:16,470 --> 03:19:18,170
Protein reduced your recovery time.

3616
03:19:18,310 --> 03:19:18,530
Aha.

3617
03:19:19,510 --> 03:19:23,270
Not sure if that's something that actually works like that in real life.

3618
03:19:23,450 --> 03:19:23,770
Maybe.

3619
03:19:24,390 --> 03:19:26,850
I guess it's, you know, you need protein to build your muscles.

3620
03:19:28,430 --> 03:19:29,790
Can I, like, throw this out somewhere?

3621
03:19:32,410 --> 03:19:34,270
Jason, don't you have a trash bin?

3622
03:19:35,340 --> 03:19:37,120
Oh wait, that would probably be in the cupboard over here.

3623
03:19:39,940 --> 03:19:40,680
Oh-ho!

3624
03:19:42,920 --> 03:19:43,560
Good throw.

3625
03:19:44,480 --> 03:19:46,500
Man, the details are off the charts.

3626
03:19:47,600 --> 03:19:48,220
It's nuts.

3627
03:19:50,020 --> 03:19:50,860
I hear a mosquito.

3628
03:19:53,500 --> 03:19:53,900
Okay.

3629
03:19:54,320 --> 03:19:55,780
Let's go get that car, shall we?

3630
03:19:55,920 --> 03:19:59,200
I actually really like that my car is still over there, and I gotta go get it.

3631
03:19:59,660 --> 03:20:02,820
In fact, why don't we try the bike again?

3632
03:20:05,660 --> 03:20:06,740
Maybe now I can use it.

3633
03:20:06,980 --> 03:20:07,680
Also, what's in here?

3634
03:20:11,880 --> 03:20:12,240
Ooh.

3635
03:20:16,120 --> 03:20:17,000
Off the hook.

3636
03:20:17,200 --> 03:20:18,520
Okay, so that's fishing stuff.

3637
03:20:20,280 --> 03:20:21,360
Magazines, books, and comics.

3638
03:20:21,520 --> 03:20:23,040
Okay, so that gets added automatically there.

3639
03:20:24,280 --> 03:20:26,820
I'm gonna come back out here and read it, though, as soon as I start fishing.

3640
03:20:28,580 --> 03:20:29,160
Hang back.

3641
03:20:34,340 --> 03:20:35,060
Wait, what?

3642
03:20:35,900 --> 03:20:36,420
Oh!

3643
03:20:37,080 --> 03:20:38,560
It's like a boxing thing!

3644
03:20:39,720 --> 03:20:40,240
Cool!

3645
03:20:42,500 --> 03:20:43,440
Get it up there!

3646
03:20:45,960 --> 03:20:46,480
Yes!

3647
03:20:47,860 --> 03:20:48,380
Okay!

3648
03:20:49,240 --> 03:20:51,780
I mean, we're tired right now, so we can't really do that.

3649
03:20:52,680 --> 03:20:55,340
Work out square on the punching bag to improve your stamina.

3650
03:21:00,800 --> 03:21:02,260
Fucking kung fu!

3651
03:21:04,560 --> 03:21:05,280
Wing-choo!

3652
03:21:06,400 --> 03:21:07,280
Wait, what's it called?

3653
03:21:07,420 --> 03:21:07,820
Wing-foo?

3654
03:21:07,880 --> 03:21:08,300
Wing-choo?

3655
03:21:10,860 --> 03:21:12,540
You know, Ip-man style.

3656
03:21:13,460 --> 03:21:14,680
There's a word for that.

3657
03:21:15,340 --> 03:21:16,820
Don't think we know it, but...

3658
03:21:19,640 --> 03:21:21,180
Let's see if we can take this bike now.

3659
03:21:23,640 --> 03:21:24,080
Yes!

3660
03:21:26,240 --> 03:21:27,120
Oh, sick!

3661
03:21:27,580 --> 03:21:30,040
Hold R2 to pedal, repeatedly tap or hold X to speed.

3662
03:21:31,060 --> 03:21:32,400
Oh my god, it looks so good.

3663
03:21:32,820 --> 03:21:34,840
This is giving me San Andreas vibes right now.

3664
03:21:35,340 --> 03:21:38,000
Hold L1 and press R1 to access your helmet from your lookout?

3665
03:21:39,592 --> 03:21:41,992
She called me a cancer...

3666
03:21:47,710 --> 03:21:49,450
Oh wait, I see.

3667
03:21:50,130 --> 03:21:50,790
Oh!

3668
03:21:54,910 --> 03:21:55,530
Oh?

3669
03:22:01,170 --> 03:22:02,450
Hey!

3670
03:22:41,890 --> 03:22:42,970
Is she drunk?

3671
03:23:16,010 --> 03:23:20,290
Yeah, you know what...

3672
03:23:24,380 --> 03:23:25,200
Aha, yeah.

3673
03:23:25,400 --> 03:23:26,860
Well, let's hope you don't snap, Shirley.

3674
03:23:32,180 --> 03:23:33,120
I'll see you later.

3675
03:23:33,680 --> 03:23:34,340
Thanks for that.

3676
03:23:34,740 --> 03:23:35,440
That was great.

3677
03:23:35,780 --> 03:23:36,060
Thank you.

3678
03:23:36,800 --> 03:23:41,800
I mean, we can go grab some whatever she wanted, some kind of alcohol for her Mai Tai.

3679
03:23:42,660 --> 03:23:44,200
Let me see what that is on the map here.

3680
03:23:46,420 --> 03:23:48,040
She said something... Oh, there it is.

3681
03:23:48,420 --> 03:23:49,300
Get Shirley's rum.

3682
03:23:49,780 --> 03:23:51,760
Your neighbor Shirley is thirsty for rum.

3683
03:23:52,020 --> 03:23:54,220
Do her a favor and pick up some from the store.

3684
03:23:54,780 --> 03:23:55,460
You got it.

3685
03:23:56,240 --> 03:23:59,680
I mean, you got to do a good deed here and there, you know?

3686
03:24:02,760 --> 03:24:03,460
Oh, man.

3687
03:24:03,880 --> 03:24:05,060
Dude, this feels so good.

3688
03:24:05,900 --> 03:24:06,260
Jeez.

3689
03:24:07,580 --> 03:24:07,840
Whoop.

3690
03:24:08,100 --> 03:24:08,680
Okay, okay.

3691
03:24:09,320 --> 03:24:10,880
Trying to keep my balance on this bike.

3692
03:24:11,120 --> 03:24:11,940
It's been a while, you know.

3693
03:24:15,620 --> 03:24:16,560
Whoop, whoop, whoop, whoop.

3694
03:24:17,320 --> 03:24:20,080
Just biking around with a shotgun on the back here.

3695
03:24:23,920 --> 03:24:25,460
Yeah, what's up, Ryan?

3696
03:24:25,940 --> 03:24:27,800
Yeah, I need you to do something for me.

3697
03:24:27,980 --> 03:24:29,780
Not sure you're gonna like it, though.

3698
03:24:30,100 --> 03:24:31,640
Whatever you need, I'm here for her.

3699
03:24:32,080 --> 03:24:32,980
It's Mandy.

3700
03:24:33,360 --> 03:24:35,340
She's behind on her rent again.

3701
03:24:35,840 --> 03:24:38,760
You gotta swing by there, see what the holdup is.

3702
03:24:39,160 --> 03:24:41,360
Mandy, can't Cal handle this one?

3703
03:24:41,640 --> 03:24:43,500
Oh, she only wants you.

3704
03:24:44,580 --> 03:24:45,720
I'm sure it's nothing.

3705
03:24:46,360 --> 03:24:48,780
Be a nice break from all that other business.

3706
03:24:49,340 --> 03:24:50,080
Thank you.

3707
03:24:51,990 --> 03:24:54,590
Wait, I just do whatever the hell for this guy?

3708
03:24:55,610 --> 03:24:56,310
Let me see.

3709
03:24:58,090 --> 03:24:58,790
Where is that?

3710
03:25:01,930 --> 03:25:03,090
Let's fix my car.

3711
03:25:03,490 --> 03:25:04,370
Collect Brian's rent.

3712
03:25:04,470 --> 03:25:04,950
Is it that one?

3713
03:25:06,350 --> 03:25:07,470
Collect Mandy's rent.

3714
03:25:07,950 --> 03:25:08,370
Okay.

3715
03:25:09,350 --> 03:25:11,430
I mean, I guess I have plenty to do here.

3716
03:25:11,510 --> 03:25:12,710
Let me go get that alcohol first.

3717
03:25:20,440 --> 03:25:21,760
I forgot the controls!

3718
03:25:22,040 --> 03:25:22,440
Oh shit!

3719
03:25:24,040 --> 03:25:24,620
Bike lane!

3720
03:25:25,120 --> 03:25:27,120
Oh wait, the bike lane is out here in the US?

3721
03:25:27,540 --> 03:25:28,320
That's crazy.

3722
03:25:29,980 --> 03:25:32,160
I don't know how much I like that.

3723
03:25:33,640 --> 03:25:34,580
That's a little scary.

3724
03:25:37,840 --> 03:25:39,300
Okay, okay, looking pretty good.

3725
03:25:39,440 --> 03:25:41,200
I wonder if I can... Oh yeah!

3726
03:25:48,470 --> 03:25:48,890
Sweet!

3727
03:25:48,890 --> 03:25:49,610
Okay then.

3728
03:25:51,190 --> 03:25:53,110
And I guess this is a good workout as well.

3729
03:25:53,270 --> 03:25:55,890
I mean, we have definitely done our duty today in the workout department.

3730
03:25:56,950 --> 03:25:57,370
Surely.

3731
03:25:57,870 --> 03:26:03,550
Of course you would know that.

3732
03:26:06,600 --> 03:26:07,420
Wait, what was that?

3733
03:26:09,040 --> 03:26:10,740
These people are driving like crazy.

3734
03:26:12,620 --> 03:26:13,560
Cardio workout!

3735
03:26:15,140 --> 03:26:15,620
Sick.

