03:59:06,040 --> 03:59:08,840
But if I open the map, maybe they still have an area?

4272
03:59:09,000 --> 03:59:09,760
Oh, yeah, they do.

4273
03:59:11,000 --> 03:59:12,900
Ah, wait a minute.

4274
03:59:14,240 --> 03:59:21,580
It's only in that area where they recognize me from my vehicle appearance and outfit.

4275
03:59:22,820 --> 03:59:24,600
That's actually so cool, man.

4276
03:59:24,740 --> 03:59:29,400
So I committed a crime in this area, so it makes sense that they would patrol this area only.

4277
03:59:30,980 --> 03:59:33,460
Yo, I really love the changes they've made.

4278
03:59:34,900 --> 03:59:36,880
To the, you know, cops and robbers.

4279
03:59:38,140 --> 03:59:38,980
It's really neat.

4280
03:59:39,420 --> 03:59:40,480
What's happening over there now?

4281
03:59:41,275 --> 03:59:44,325
Trying to give you a chance here, sir. Stand on one leg for me.

4282
03:59:44,325 --> 03:59:49,992
Ay, I'm tryin' to give you a chance, coppa choppa! Pew, pew, pew! Bam, bam! Pap-woo!

4283
03:59:50,292 --> 03:59:52,192
Sir. I need you to take this seriously, or you are going to jail.

4284
03:59:52,192 --> 03:59:54,842
Okay.

4285
03:59:54,840 --> 03:59:58,414
Hey, why don't you assholes ride horses anymore?

4286
03:59:58,632 --> 04:00:00,410
Y-you like riding those narc-mobiles?

4287
04:00:00,408 --> 04:00:03,842
I love horsies.

4288
04:00:04,290 --> 04:00:05,790
I'm gonna put this in there.

4289
04:00:06,950 --> 04:00:08,490
Uh, still long arms.

4290
04:00:08,930 --> 04:00:10,750
I need you to focus.

4291
04:00:11,130 --> 04:00:12,390
You are really pushing.

4292
04:00:13,230 --> 04:00:14,130
Eyes on me.

4293
04:00:14,470 --> 04:00:15,970
We're gonna do a nose test.

4294
04:00:16,250 --> 04:00:17,330
Arms out like a scarecrow.

4295
04:00:17,330 --> 04:00:18,450
Hey, I ain't got a nose, copper.

4296
04:00:18,870 --> 04:00:19,630
I'm free.

4297
04:00:20,130 --> 04:00:20,410
Jesus.

4298
04:00:21,910 --> 04:00:24,190
You do it, or it's over.

4299
04:00:26,390 --> 04:00:27,170
Did you?

4300
04:00:27,592 --> 04:00:29,842
Get your handsoutta there! Stop digging in there!

4301
04:00:29,842 --> 04:00:30,942
Oh yeah, bam!

4302
04:00:33,842 --> 04:00:34,675
Oo-wee! Now that's a nose test!

4303
04:00:39,330 --> 04:00:41,050
What is he doing, man?

4304
04:00:42,030 --> 04:00:43,790
No, no way!

4305
04:00:45,542 --> 04:00:49,975
Wee-woo wee-woo! My narc-mobile now, pig!

4306
04:00:50,842 --> 04:00:52,892
Shit! Oh, fuck. Oh, we're so fucked.

4307
04:00:53,740 --> 04:00:55,720
Wait, I gotta see this.

4308
04:00:56,920 --> 04:00:57,660
Hold on.

4309
04:00:57,860 --> 04:00:58,380
Hold on.

4310
04:00:58,480 --> 04:00:59,100
Hold the phone.

4311
04:01:00,420 --> 04:01:02,320
I need to follow them.

4312
04:01:02,480 --> 04:01:04,540
I need to see what the fuck's gonna happen there.

4313
04:01:06,780 --> 04:01:08,800
I can't believe he got away like that.

4314
04:01:10,360 --> 04:01:11,160
That's crazy.

4315
04:01:15,440 --> 04:01:17,520
I wanna see if they actually lead somewhere.

4316
04:01:20,480 --> 04:01:21,900
Oh, they're already gone.

4317
04:01:23,920 --> 04:01:25,040
Damn, I lost them.

4318
04:01:26,060 --> 04:01:26,480
Shit.

4319
04:01:28,440 --> 04:01:30,620
Okay, well, that was funny.

4320
04:01:32,760 --> 04:01:34,560
Let me check out these places here.

4321
04:01:37,620 --> 04:01:38,640
How's it hanging, fellas?

4322
04:01:39,560 --> 04:01:41,860
Oh, I guess most things are closed at this hour, huh?

4323
04:01:43,700 --> 04:01:44,680
Except this place.

4324
04:01:44,680 --> 04:01:45,700
That seems to be open.

4325
04:01:51,860 --> 04:01:53,640
Eh, good enough parking.

4326
04:01:54,420 --> 04:01:55,760
Could be better.

4327
04:01:56,220 --> 04:01:57,280
Don't matter.

4328
04:01:59,580 --> 04:02:01,940
Nifty Threats Islandware.

4329
04:02:06,540 --> 04:02:07,780
Hello there.

4330
04:02:12,220 --> 04:02:13,220
I'm good.

4331
04:02:13,780 --> 04:02:16,000
I've shopped for clothes before.

4332
04:02:16,460 --> 04:02:17,980
I know how it works.

4333
04:02:19,300 --> 04:02:21,200
Man, the details.

4334
04:02:22,340 --> 04:02:25,220
Look at all the knick-knacks on the shelves and stuff.

4335
04:02:26,160 --> 04:02:27,640
Basic sweatshirts.

4336
04:02:28,680 --> 04:02:29,200
Ooh!

4337
04:02:32,800 --> 04:02:33,780
That's kind of nice.

4338
04:02:35,640 --> 04:02:37,000
Oh wait, that's the one I own already.

4339
04:02:38,640 --> 04:02:41,060
Well, I guess it's a good thing I like the clothes I have.

4340
04:02:42,580 --> 04:02:42,940
Jackets.

4341
04:02:44,820 --> 04:02:45,560
US Army.

4342
04:02:46,460 --> 04:02:49,600
We don't want to lay it on too thick that we used to be in the army, you know?

4343
04:02:51,740 --> 04:02:52,480
Camo is cringe.

4344
04:02:55,400 --> 04:02:56,340
Vintage eyewear.

4345
04:03:09,240 --> 04:03:11,060
Bargain sweatshirts.

4346
04:03:14,870 --> 04:03:15,990
That's more like it.

4347
04:03:18,030 --> 04:03:20,090
Soldiers love sprunk inside them.

4348
04:03:21,490 --> 04:03:26,350
That's not... Why would you... You know what, fine.

4349
04:03:28,070 --> 04:03:29,070
We'll buy that one.

4350
04:03:29,370 --> 04:03:32,170
In fact, we'll wear it too, because the cops are looking for us.

4351
04:03:32,710 --> 04:03:33,910
Outfit heat cleared.

4352
04:03:34,330 --> 04:03:34,810
Wonderful.

4353
04:03:35,670 --> 04:03:38,690
Now, let me change my thingy here.

4354
04:03:40,190 --> 04:03:41,970
Take those off, put that on.

4355
04:03:42,910 --> 04:03:44,510
The cops never knew what hit him.

4356
04:03:45,350 --> 04:03:46,250
Appearance heat cleared.

4357
04:03:46,370 --> 04:03:48,090
So now we just need to fix our car heat.

4358
04:03:48,850 --> 04:03:49,750
Nah, I'm good, thanks.

4359
04:03:57,910 --> 04:03:58,610
Who's talking?

4360
04:04:33,000 --> 04:04:34,760
Yeah, sorry.

4361
04:04:35,120 --> 04:04:35,280
Listen.

4362
04:04:41,330 --> 04:04:46,570
I mean, I was just, you know, entrenched or enchanted by your conversation.

4363
04:04:49,110 --> 04:04:51,910
Can't that man, you know, drop some eaves here and there?

4364
04:04:54,190 --> 04:04:54,930
Heat cleared!

4365
04:04:57,090 --> 04:04:59,570
So does that mean my cars are so cleared or what?

4366
04:05:00,530 --> 04:05:01,110
Let's see.

4367
04:05:03,350 --> 04:05:03,770
Nice.

4368
04:05:04,710 --> 04:05:05,910
Let's go get the bike.

4369
04:05:06,790 --> 04:05:08,130
The quest for the bike.

4370
04:05:13,490 --> 04:05:15,350
Man, there's just so much happening.

4371
04:05:16,190 --> 04:05:17,850
This game is, like, crazy.

4372
04:05:18,410 --> 04:05:20,930
And it feels like I've barely even started the game.

4373
04:05:21,790 --> 04:05:24,270
There's so many, like, conversations happening everywhere.

4374
04:05:24,490 --> 04:05:25,730
The city looks amazing.

4375
04:05:27,270 --> 04:05:29,510
And I feel like I've barely been doing anything.

4376
04:05:29,510 --> 04:05:33,410
And yet, you know, it's been so dense and so fun.

4377
04:05:34,610 --> 04:05:35,090
Already.

4378
04:05:39,510 --> 04:05:40,270
What was that?

4379
04:05:42,590 --> 04:05:43,970
Did someone just scream at us?

4380
04:05:44,970 --> 04:05:45,690
Okay, whatever.

4381
04:05:50,150 --> 04:05:54,370
I wonder if there's like a way to turn on different lights here.

4382
04:05:58,970 --> 04:05:59,430
Oh!

4383
04:06:01,010 --> 04:06:02,370
You can put a blinker on!

4384
04:06:04,090 --> 04:06:04,550
What?

4385
04:06:08,490 --> 04:06:09,530
What was that?

4386
04:06:15,050 --> 04:06:17,030
Fuck you.

4387
04:06:17,210 --> 04:06:18,210
What the fuck are you doing?

4388
04:06:20,910 --> 04:06:22,110
I'm an army man.

4389
04:06:22,730 --> 04:06:23,790
Why would you do this?

4390
04:06:26,530 --> 04:06:27,070
Come here.

4391
04:06:27,990 --> 04:06:29,490
You can't be in the middle of the street.

4392
04:06:33,230 --> 04:06:34,010
Come on.

4393
04:06:34,710 --> 04:06:35,550
There we go.

4394
04:06:36,370 --> 04:06:36,850
Alright.

4395
04:06:38,610 --> 04:06:39,090
Here.

4396
04:06:39,610 --> 04:06:41,350
You better take care of your girl here.

4397
04:06:41,730 --> 04:06:42,210
Okay?

4398
04:06:42,810 --> 04:06:43,990
Wait, they have a pistol in there?

4399
04:06:47,130 --> 04:06:47,830
Which one?

4400
04:06:49,870 --> 04:06:50,810
Wait, I'm confused.

4401
04:06:54,030 --> 04:06:54,450
Aha!

4402
04:06:54,830 --> 04:06:54,930
Ooh!

4403
04:06:55,490 --> 04:06:56,650
They got some cash, too!

4404
04:06:57,370 --> 04:06:57,790
Shit!

4405
04:06:58,950 --> 04:06:59,370
Alright!

4406
04:07:00,430 --> 04:07:01,110
Not bad.

4407
04:07:01,550 --> 04:07:03,270
Hey, listen, you can't be blocking traffic, alright?

4408
04:07:03,470 --> 04:07:05,390
I'm gonna put you out here until you sober up.

4409
04:07:06,970 --> 04:07:08,690
Or come to your senses, I should say.

4410
04:07:09,770 --> 04:07:10,470
There you go.

4411
04:07:11,510 --> 04:07:13,370
Can I call the cops or an ambulance, maybe?

4412
04:07:16,350 --> 04:07:19,470
That's what happens when you mess with JV.

4413
04:07:22,270 --> 04:07:23,590
No, JD, I guess.

4414
04:07:24,110 --> 04:07:26,290
I can't even do acronyms.

4415
04:07:27,590 --> 04:07:28,050
See ya?

4416
04:07:28,110 --> 04:07:28,250
Wait.

4417
04:07:30,670 --> 04:07:32,310
Why is there a corpse in the middle of the street?

4418
04:07:34,310 --> 04:07:35,170
I didn't do that.

4419
04:07:36,150 --> 04:07:36,990
That wasn't me.

4420
04:07:38,430 --> 04:07:38,870
Anyway.

4421
04:07:39,490 --> 04:07:42,390
What I was trying to say before this all happened... I can have blinkers!

4422
04:07:42,570 --> 04:07:42,990
Look!

4423
04:07:45,170 --> 04:07:46,090
That's neat, isn't it?

4424
04:07:48,630 --> 04:07:49,690
The details, man.

4425
04:07:49,910 --> 04:07:50,870
I'm in love with them.

4426
04:07:54,330 --> 04:07:56,990
Someone got stopped there again by the cops.

4427
04:08:11,400 --> 04:08:12,980
If only I could hear the radio, huh?

4428
04:08:14,580 --> 04:08:14,900
Okay.

4429
04:08:15,540 --> 04:08:16,140
Question, though.

4430
04:08:16,260 --> 04:08:23,880
If we can pick up that bike and put it in the trunk of this car, then this is truly already the best Grand Theft Auto.

4431
04:08:25,040 --> 04:08:26,700
That's what's going to decide this right now.

4432
04:08:34,610 --> 04:08:35,870
Something's happening in those woods.

4433
04:08:36,010 --> 04:08:37,610
That's the second time I've seen someone come out of there.

4434
04:08:39,450 --> 04:08:40,550
What are they doing in there?

4435
04:08:43,310 --> 04:08:44,730
Don't tell me they recognized me.

4436
04:08:47,210 --> 04:08:48,330
Is my bike still here?

4437
04:08:49,670 --> 04:08:50,690
My bike is gone.

4438
04:08:52,210 --> 04:08:52,610
No.

4439
04:08:54,750 --> 04:08:56,210
Maybe it spawned back at home.

4440
04:08:58,850 --> 04:08:59,570
Wait a sec.

4441
04:09:01,700 --> 04:09:03,640
There's a wank scan nearby.

4442
04:09:04,060 --> 04:09:07,560
When in range, hold up to open the wanks app and scan it.

4443
04:09:08,360 --> 04:09:09,320
What do you mean?

4444
04:09:09,720 --> 04:09:10,240
That one?

4445
04:09:13,280 --> 04:09:15,400
Okay, but why is that important?

4446
04:09:17,220 --> 04:09:18,960
SUV, good condition.

4447
04:09:22,480 --> 04:09:23,760
For stealing, maybe.

4448
04:09:27,520 --> 04:09:29,280
I just want to look at this city here.

4449
04:09:45,980 --> 04:09:48,220
She's just chilling out there with a can of beer.

4450
04:10:05,100 --> 04:10:06,600
Whoa, look at that over there.

4451
04:10:08,040 --> 04:10:08,840
Skyscrapers and stuff.

4452
04:10:09,540 --> 04:10:10,260
The inner city.

4453
04:10:12,260 --> 04:10:16,780
I also have a statue here of a... Is that a kingfisher?

4454
04:10:19,000 --> 04:10:20,180
It may be, actually.

4455
04:10:23,560 --> 04:10:25,260
Okay, let's get the car and get out of here.

4456
04:10:28,280 --> 04:10:28,860
Get in.

4457
04:10:32,060 --> 04:10:33,040
Alright, back again.

4458
04:10:37,800 --> 04:10:39,440
God, the driving feels so good.

4459
04:10:40,200 --> 04:10:42,020
It took a little getting used to at first.

4460
04:10:42,220 --> 04:10:44,820
It was very sensitive, but now I'm really digging it, you know?

4461
04:10:54,090 --> 04:10:54,830
Oh, shit.

4462
04:10:57,070 --> 04:10:58,930
Sorry about that, brother.

4463
04:11:01,310 --> 04:11:04,290
I wonder if the cops will come after me for traffic violations.

4464
04:11:07,150 --> 04:11:07,950
Probably not.

4465
04:11:10,430 --> 04:11:11,110
Come on.

4466
04:11:12,930 --> 04:11:13,930
Move it, asshole.

4467
04:11:23,410 --> 04:11:25,490
I understand how road rage is a thing.

4468
04:11:26,690 --> 04:11:31,050
Like, just, you know, getting angry at other drivers in the video game.

4469
04:11:31,890 --> 04:11:32,890
Should tell you enough.

4470
04:11:35,430 --> 04:11:36,210
I understand.

4471
04:11:48,700 --> 04:11:51,660
We're gonna have to progress the story a little bit here, I think.

4472
04:11:54,320 --> 04:11:57,380
But I love that whole mission with Mandy and that.

4473
04:11:58,120 --> 04:11:59,100
That was so good.

4474
04:12:00,760 --> 04:12:01,620
What's happening here?

4475
04:12:06,360 --> 04:12:07,760
Look at the way these lights, though.

4476
04:12:08,840 --> 04:12:09,440
What's happening?

4477
04:12:13,640 --> 04:12:14,700
Oh, he's on the phone.

4478
04:12:24,290 --> 04:12:29,390
It is so satisfying, guys, to just cruise through the city here.

4479
04:12:37,270 --> 04:12:38,890
Let me overtake these assholes.

4480
04:12:40,710 --> 04:12:41,790
A little too slow.

4481
04:12:43,090 --> 04:12:44,710
I'm gonna try and steal a truck soon.

4482
04:12:45,870 --> 04:12:46,850
I wanna drive that.

4483
04:12:46,910 --> 04:12:47,850
I wanna drive all the vehicles.

4484
04:13:00,700 --> 04:13:02,760
CSL, Coastal Shipping Logistics.

4485
04:13:05,620 --> 04:13:07,000
Oh, you know what I could do?

4486
04:13:07,640 --> 04:13:08,960
I could text and drive.

4487
04:13:13,080 --> 04:13:15,080
That system is actually so beautiful.

4488
04:13:21,900 --> 04:13:23,100
I went too far, didn't I?

4489
04:13:23,300 --> 04:13:24,280
I went way too far.

4490
04:13:24,560 --> 04:13:25,160
But you know what?

4491
04:13:25,180 --> 04:13:25,520
That's okay.

4492
04:13:25,840 --> 04:13:26,480
We can go do this.

4493
04:13:27,940 --> 04:13:30,060
Fixing the car is something Lucia will appreciate.

4494
04:13:31,380 --> 04:13:33,360
And is the thing I'm driving now the Ganado?

4495
04:13:35,340 --> 04:13:36,780
It says Vapid on the back.

4496
04:13:40,280 --> 04:13:42,340
I'm gonna assume that it is the Ganado.

4497
04:13:44,560 --> 04:13:45,360
Oh, wait, wait, wait.

4498
04:13:45,480 --> 04:13:49,060
No, they're probably talking about... the red one.

4499
04:13:54,660 --> 04:13:55,520
Let me just go in here.

4500
04:13:57,140 --> 04:13:58,240
See if they're open right now.

4501
04:14:00,180 --> 04:14:00,500
Hey!

4502
04:14:03,492 --> 04:14:06,442
Oh hey! Jason, right?

4503
04:14:08,690 --> 04:14:09,290
What's up, Joey?

4504
04:14:10,142 --> 04:14:11,142
Hey, yeah, that's me.

4505
04:14:31,400 --> 04:14:33,220
I'm gonna tell you the same thing I tell Donnie.

4506
04:14:33,400 --> 04:14:34,680
Let's keep this thing reciprocal.

4507
04:14:34,960 --> 04:14:35,900
I'll get her back in shape.

4508
04:14:36,080 --> 04:14:37,020
On me this time.

4509
04:14:37,140 --> 04:14:38,800
Long as next time you bust it up.

4510
04:14:39,020 --> 04:14:39,720
And trust, brother.

4511
04:14:40,160 --> 04:14:42,100
With y'all, there's gonna be a next time.

4512
04:14:42,360 --> 04:14:43,680
You bring your business here.

4513
04:14:44,060 --> 04:14:45,180
How's that sound to you?

4514
04:14:45,260 --> 04:14:45,560
Sure.

4515
04:14:46,060 --> 04:14:46,440
Yeah, deal.

4516
04:14:46,660 --> 04:14:50,140
Oh, I got some bearings for that 7-liter in the back if you want to get it running smooth.

4517
04:14:50,540 --> 04:14:51,900
I can knock a few bucks off.

4518
04:14:52,040 --> 04:14:52,840
Lick of paint, too.

4519
04:14:53,020 --> 04:14:53,320
Sweet.

4520
04:14:53,520 --> 04:14:53,780
Thanks.

4521
04:14:54,420 --> 04:14:54,920
Go ahead.

4522
04:14:55,100 --> 04:14:55,960
Pull up in the shop.

4523
04:14:58,520 --> 04:14:59,460
Okay, okay.

4524
04:14:59,860 --> 04:15:00,860
So this was the Ganado.

4525
04:15:01,020 --> 04:15:03,760
I also noticed it does say Ganado on the side there.

4526
04:15:07,225 --> 04:15:09,792
Alright, alright, let's fix her up.

4527
04:15:10,040 --> 04:15:11,380
Honestly, kind of a cool car.

4528
04:15:12,700 --> 04:15:13,560
I feel it.

4529
04:15:14,540 --> 04:15:15,300
Repair for free.

4530
04:15:15,520 --> 04:15:17,740
You'll need to repair your vehicle before making modifications.

4531
04:15:18,020 --> 04:15:18,340
Yes.

4532
04:15:26,000 --> 04:15:26,900
Oh, wait.

4533
04:15:27,000 --> 04:15:27,760
This is so satisfying.

4534
04:15:29,300 --> 04:15:30,080
Engine upgrade.

4535
04:15:30,320 --> 04:15:31,160
Oh, that's going to cost me.

4536
04:15:31,360 --> 04:15:31,400
