Thinking we sent Kingfishers a message.

5801
05:45:48,110 --> 05:45:50,770
Hit him back over by the fishing stacks or shacks.

5802
05:45:51,330 --> 05:45:52,470
Show him who's king out here.

5803
05:45:52,870 --> 05:45:54,610
Gonna be some cash and stash over there too.

5804
05:45:55,250 --> 05:45:55,810
Go get him.

5805
