Coming around.

5826
05:47:08,830 --> 05:47:09,250
Booyah!

5827
05:47:10,350 --> 05:47:10,770
Yeah!

5828
05:47:11,730 --> 05:47:13,550
Oh my god, that's awesome.

5829
05:47:14,450 --> 05:47:15,190
