5832
05:47:26,610 --> 05:47:27,050
Perfect.

5833
05:47:27,050 --> 05:47:27,490
No!

5834
05:47:32,070 --> 05:47:33,190
Man, this is not easy.

5835
05:47:35,230 --> 05:47:36,270
One last, one last.

5836
05:47:40,500 --> 05:47:41,040
Perfect.

5837
05:47:41,040 --> 05:47:43,500
Okay, I'm not sure how to actually aim this.

5838
05:47:43,960 --> 05:47:44,600
One last.

5839
05:47:46,720 --> 05:47:48,340
