5840
05:47:50,460 --> 05:47:51,660
Ah, too early, maybe.

5841
05:47:52,620 --> 05:47:54,700
Oh, close one.

5842
05:47:56,900 --> 05:47:57,760
Very close.

5843
05:48:02,580 --> 05:48:04,440
