07:10:15,530 --> 07:10:16,810
Let's see what we can do with this.

7177
07:10:20,130 --> 07:10:21,070
Can I assume?

7178
07:10:21,250 --> 07:10:21,430
Oh, yeah.

7179
07:10:26,750 --> 07:10:28,910
What's up with this, like, aspect format?

7180
07:10:29,030 --> 07:10:33,350
Can we not make it a bit bigger?

7181
07:10:35,450 --> 07:10:38,810
Zoom, selfie, grid, light off.

7182
07:10:39,930 --> 07:10:40,890
Yeah, light off for sure.

7183
07:10:43,950 --> 07:10:45,610
I mean, that's fine, I guess.

7184
07:10:49,850 --> 07:10:54,130
Although I am hating on you a little bit, Jason, for not using landscape mode.

7185
07:11:01,070 --> 07:11:02,270
Dude, wow.

7186
07:11:04,490 --> 07:11:05,790
Holy bejesus.

7187
07:11:10,730 --> 07:11:12,130
Let me do a selfie here.

7188
07:11:16,990 --> 07:11:18,610
Is there a filter on something?

7189
07:11:18,730 --> 07:11:19,490
His eyes look weird.

7190
07:11:21,950 --> 07:11:22,950
Man, look at that.

7191
07:11:30,890 --> 07:11:32,810
What's up dude, just hanging out in my crib.

7192
07:11:39,170 --> 07:11:41,610
Oh man, this is too good.

7193
07:11:47,950 --> 07:11:51,450
I just thought of that video of the guy in his garage, you know?

7194
07:11:52,150 --> 07:11:57,810
Hey, just here in my garage, standing next to my Ferrari or whatever.

7195
07:11:58,630 --> 07:12:01,450
But I value knowledge, you know?

7196
07:12:02,790 --> 07:12:03,610
There you go.

7197
07:12:03,770 --> 07:12:04,390
Have a mouse.

7198
07:12:05,030 --> 07:12:05,910
Enjoy, Dolores.

7199
07:12:10,750 --> 07:12:11,370
Eat it.

7200
07:12:12,010 --> 07:12:12,450
Attack!

7201
07:12:14,610 --> 07:12:15,270
Good girl.

7202
07:12:16,470 --> 07:12:17,510
Okay, let's have that beer.

7203
07:12:21,490 --> 07:12:24,110
Oh my god, it actually is in my fridge now.

7204
07:12:24,330 --> 07:12:24,890
That's sick.

7205
07:12:25,850 --> 07:12:26,890
Wait, Ecola soda?

7206
07:12:28,630 --> 07:12:29,730
Oh, right, Ecola.

7207
07:12:30,010 --> 07:12:31,590
I was like, wait a minute, is that the sickness?

7208
07:12:31,790 --> 07:12:32,610
No, but that's Ebola.

7209
07:12:33,630 --> 07:12:36,170
I'm taking a lager beer.

7210
07:12:39,650 --> 07:12:40,230
Hell yeah.

7211
07:12:41,790 --> 07:12:42,370
You know what?

7212
07:12:42,430 --> 07:12:43,590
I'm taking that with me outside.

7213
07:12:45,130 --> 07:12:50,930
I'm gonna go... I'm gonna go catch some fish at night.

7214
07:12:51,310 --> 07:12:52,370
That's probably a bad idea, right?

7215
07:12:52,470 --> 07:12:52,930
Actually, it's not.

7216
07:12:52,990 --> 07:12:53,610
It sounds amazing.

7217
07:12:54,650 --> 07:12:56,950
Let's get out there at night with a beer in hand.

7218
07:12:57,830 --> 07:12:59,730
See if we can beat Cal's record, huh?

7219
07:13:00,710 --> 07:13:04,210
Can't let him think that he's better than us when it comes to fishing.

7220
07:13:12,660 --> 07:13:15,140
Wait, how do I... Oh, yeah.

7221
07:13:17,500 --> 07:13:18,220
This way.

7222
07:13:22,900 --> 07:13:23,440
Damn!

7223
07:13:25,720 --> 07:13:26,580
What have you?

7224
07:13:37,440 --> 07:13:38,360
There we go.

7225
07:13:42,140 --> 07:13:43,880
I love that he's still holding the drink.

7226
07:13:48,700 --> 07:13:50,800
I can drink while driving the boat?

7227
07:13:50,920 --> 07:13:51,600
Oh my god.

7228
07:13:52,920 --> 07:13:54,160
I freaking love it.

7229
07:13:55,120 --> 07:13:56,940
Do we still have the place highlighted?

7230
07:13:57,100 --> 07:13:57,980
Oh, it's the wrong place.

7231
07:13:58,560 --> 07:13:59,920
It's over here I need to go.

7232
07:14:00,820 --> 07:14:01,560
There you go.

7233
07:14:03,620 --> 07:14:05,440
Look at the lights in the boat as well.

7234
07:14:05,660 --> 07:14:06,600
Oh, man.

7235
07:14:11,420 --> 07:14:11,860
Cheers.

7236
07:14:15,000 --> 07:14:16,300
This is the life right here.

7237
07:14:25,900 --> 07:14:30,620
Oh man, I should have taken off a little earlier so that we still would have had some nice sun.

7238
07:14:31,100 --> 07:14:33,360
I'm gonna be in pitch black darkness right now.

7239
07:14:36,880 --> 07:14:38,600
This is kind of sketchy, isn't it?

7240
07:14:39,280 --> 07:14:44,500
Like, why am I in my boat in the middle of the ocean here at night?

7241
07:14:46,320 --> 07:14:47,440
Am I dumping something?

7242
07:14:49,420 --> 07:14:51,220
Yo, I bet you could probably do that.

7243
07:14:52,140 --> 07:14:53,600
I will have to try and...

7244
07:14:54,240 --> 07:14:56,400
You know, chop up a body and bring it out here.

7245
07:14:58,140 --> 07:14:59,720
And put it in little plastic bags.

7246
07:15:04,900 --> 07:15:06,440
Okay, I think we're almost there.

7247
07:15:14,800 --> 07:15:16,400
So this is where Cal was.

7248
07:15:22,320 --> 07:15:24,000
Wait, he actually went pretty far.

7249
07:15:30,080 --> 07:15:31,220
Look at the blimp back there.

7250
07:15:31,680 --> 07:15:33,260
I bet you can drive it.

7251
07:15:42,220 --> 07:15:42,840
Are we here?

7252
07:15:44,420 --> 07:15:45,700
Oh, it's within this circle.

7253
07:15:53,850 --> 07:15:55,070
Right here.

7254
07:15:57,930 --> 07:15:59,550
Oh yeah.

7255
07:16:08,030 --> 07:16:09,430
Ah.

7256
07:16:10,710 --> 07:16:11,970
Okay.

7257
07:16:14,810 --> 07:16:15,670
Let's get to it.

7258
07:16:17,310 --> 07:16:18,510
Cal, I'm coming for you.

7259
07:16:19,650 --> 07:16:22,730
You're in a fishing spot for large stoplight parrotfish.

7260
07:16:23,350 --> 07:16:24,010
Got it.

7261
07:16:29,530 --> 07:16:30,550
Nothing here, huh?

7262
07:16:32,530 --> 07:16:34,110
What are you doing?

7263
07:16:35,110 --> 07:16:36,450
Why did you drop it like that?

7264
07:16:38,250 --> 07:16:38,890
Oh no.

7265
07:16:39,790 --> 07:16:41,230
Can you please pick that up again?

7266
07:16:43,070 --> 07:16:44,230
Jason, you dummy.

7267
07:16:45,370 --> 07:16:46,510
Rabbit, thank you.

7268
07:16:47,950 --> 07:16:49,490
Put it back in its place now.

7269
07:16:50,090 --> 07:16:50,610
Normally.

7270
07:16:52,290 --> 07:16:52,990
Thank you.

7271
07:16:57,580 --> 07:16:59,500
I think we gotta go to the other side of this island.

7272
07:17:16,020 --> 07:17:18,100
Ooh, I think we found something here.

7273
07:17:19,880 --> 07:17:20,520
Right there.

7274
07:17:24,760 --> 07:17:25,640
Let's try this spot.

7275
07:17:29,790 --> 07:17:30,950
Now, where was it?

7276
07:17:31,770 --> 07:17:33,110
Ooh, there's a lot right there.

7277
07:17:33,330 --> 07:17:33,770
This is perfect.

7278
07:17:36,230 --> 07:17:37,070
And... go!

7279
07:17:37,575 --> 07:17:39,008
Let's see if this is still the spot.

7280
07:17:40,370 --> 07:17:41,710
It definitely is.

7281
07:17:42,810 --> 07:17:44,170
Slowly pulling in.

7282
07:17:51,220 --> 07:17:52,320
I got one.

7283
07:17:55,080 --> 07:17:57,060
We gotta beat 900 grams.

7284
07:17:57,620 --> 07:17:58,440
Oh.

7285
07:18:02,840 --> 07:18:04,460
It was actually close.

7286
07:18:05,000 --> 07:18:07,320
826, 862 grams.

7287
07:18:08,560 --> 07:18:09,420
Out with you.

7288
07:18:11,320 --> 07:18:12,560
Try that again.

7289
07:18:14,620 --> 07:18:16,040
And away.

7290
07:18:17,680 --> 07:18:19,260
Oh, that was a far one.

7291
07:18:25,960 --> 07:18:27,220
Oof, already.

7292
07:18:34,320 --> 07:18:36,000
Not fighting back very much.

7293
07:18:39,240 --> 07:18:40,300
Oh, there we go.

7294
07:18:47,340 --> 07:18:47,980
761.

7295
07:18:48,800 --> 07:18:50,340
Blue-striped grunt.

7296
07:18:55,940 --> 07:18:57,460
We're getting a lot of focus from this.

7297
07:19:00,680 --> 07:19:02,280
That one, that one right there.

7298
07:19:03,780 --> 07:19:04,600
That's massive.

7299
07:19:08,180 --> 07:19:08,900
Oh yeah.

7300
07:19:20,570 --> 07:19:21,430
Come on.

7301
07:19:23,750 --> 07:19:24,290
Ah.

7302
07:19:25,850 --> 07:19:26,590
Didn't bite.

7303
07:19:28,390 --> 07:19:29,170
One more.

7304
07:19:35,390 --> 07:19:37,190
Dude, I need to go fishing in real life.

7305
07:19:48,470 --> 07:19:50,050
What the fuck?

7306
07:19:54,570 --> 07:19:55,950
What's happening?

7307
07:20:10,850 --> 07:20:12,650
She just bumped into that boat like twice.

7308
07:20:15,390 --> 07:20:16,490
Ah, they're having fun.

7309
07:20:17,710 --> 07:20:18,470
Ooh, big fish!

7310
07:20:20,670 --> 07:20:22,510
Wait, where did my thing go?

7311
07:20:26,090 --> 07:20:29,850
Oh no, did I... did I drop it in the ocean?

7312
07:20:33,100 --> 07:20:33,840
Oh no.

7313
07:20:34,800 --> 07:20:36,020
Jason, you dumbass.

7314
07:20:36,820 --> 07:20:37,420
You know what?

7315
07:20:37,460 --> 07:20:38,700
It's too late to be fishing anyway.

7316
07:20:39,940 --> 07:20:40,820
We gotta go back.

7317
07:20:42,280 --> 07:20:44,200
I may have to go buy some new fishing rods.

7318
07:20:44,300 --> 07:20:44,960
That was a mistake.

7319
07:20:47,580 --> 07:20:48,660
Embarrassing stuff right there.

7320
07:20:55,040 --> 07:20:55,700
Back home.

7321
07:20:58,240 --> 07:21:00,880
The idea was to fish during golden hour, right?

7322
07:21:01,440 --> 07:21:03,420
Or at sunset, and I kind of failed.

7323
07:21:05,200 --> 07:21:07,380
Dude, look at the lights from that city.

7324
07:21:22,560 --> 07:21:23,980
A feast for the eyes.

7325
07:21:29,000 --> 07:21:31,380
Oh, I just realized you can see the time in the bottom left.

7326
07:21:35,380 --> 07:21:36,160
8 o'clock.

7327
07:21:39,740 --> 07:21:41,400
Dude, even this boat needs fuel.

7328
07:21:42,400 --> 07:21:44,440
It has a fuel gauge and an engine gauge.

7329
07:21:48,660 --> 07:21:51,640
So I guess I also gotta perform repairs on this or maintain it.

7330
07:22:03,960 --> 07:22:04,840
Oh, man.

7331
07:22:05,300 --> 07:22:06,520
I need to take a picture of this.

7332
07:22:09,620 --> 07:22:13,880
Not with the binoculars, with my... Wait, what is this?

7333
07:22:14,860 --> 07:22:15,300
Oh!

7334
07:22:15,700 --> 07:22:16,360
No shit!

7335
07:22:17,160 --> 07:22:22,480
I just have a flashlight that I can... How does that work?

7336
07:22:26,240 --> 07:22:26,940
No way!

7337
07:22:33,620 --> 07:22:34,100
Dude!

7338
07:22:34,100 --> 07:22:35,480
Fuck, that looks good.

7339
07:22:36,520 --> 07:22:38,640
I'm out here looking for predators in the bushes.

7340
07:22:43,020 --> 07:22:45,160
I can cosplay as a coast guard or something.

7341
07:22:47,440 --> 07:22:52,580
I can't believe I lost my freaking... fishing rod.

7342
07:22:54,720 --> 07:22:55,880
What else do I have here?

7343
07:22:58,940 --> 07:23:00,980
Oh, fuck me.

7344
07:23:02,180 --> 07:23:04,180
It was on me the entire time.

7345
07:23:05,460 --> 07:23:07,060
Well, shit.

7346
07:23:08,700 --> 07:23:09,480
That's okay.

7347
07:23:10,520 --> 07:23:12,180
I'm going to take one more picture here.

7348
07:23:12,920 --> 07:23:15,320
With my camera.

7349
07:23:17,020 --> 07:23:18,580
I'm kind of addicted to this already.

7350
07:23:20,220 --> 07:23:21,740
I mean, look at that.

7351
07:23:29,090 --> 07:23:30,630
I want to have one with some stars.

7352
07:23:32,550 --> 07:23:34,750
I think it's not late enough yet.

7353
07:23:35,210 --> 07:23:35,830
Planet, maybe.

7354
07:23:37,910 --> 07:23:39,310
Let's have one with the boat in front.

7355
07:23:40,170 --> 07:23:41,510
Nah, that's not a good picture.

7356
07:23:42,490 --> 07:23:45,070
If anything, it needs to happen late at night when the stars come out.

7357
07:24:18,540 --> 07:24:19,440
Perfect parking.

7358
07:24:22,080 --> 07:24:23,220
Ah, good enough.

7359
07:24:29,940 --> 07:24:31,780
Well, that was a failure of a mission.

7360
07:24:33,120 --> 07:24:34,660
Didn't catch anything worthwhile.

7361
07:24:35,900 --> 07:24:38,640
And I thought I lost my fishing rod when I didn't.

7362
07:24:41,870 --> 07:24:44,470
Shit like that makes me angry.

7363
07:24:45,930 --> 07:24:47,450
Fucking stupid fish.

7364
07:24:48,070 --> 07:24:50,270
I hate you, fucking parrot fish.

7365
07:24:58,250 --> 07:24:58,910
Okay.

7366
07:25:00,350 --> 07:25:01,430
Let me see here.

7367
07:25:08,340 --> 07:25:09,140
Oh, Raceways!

7368
07:25:10,720 --> 07:25:11,500
Elimination Races.

7369
07:25:11,760 --> 07:25:12,260
Where is this?

7370
07:25:13,960 --> 07:25:17,540
It is in... Hamlet.

7371
07:25:17,960 --> 07:25:19,740
Oh yeah, there's a racetrack there, you can see it.

7372
07:25:24,140 --> 07:25:24,860
What's that?

7373
07:25:26,120 --> 07:25:27,360
Oh yeah, steal the scooter.

7374
07:25:28,540 --> 07:25:29,500
Basketball hoops.

7375
07:25:30,760 --> 07:25:31,640
Stunt jumps.

7376
07:25:34,300 --> 07:25:35,080
Wait, really?

7377
07:25:36,440 --> 07:25:38,480
Oh, isn't that the one I already was on?

7378
07:25:39,920 --> 07:25:41,280
I did that already, I believe.

7379
07:25:46,940 --> 07:25:47,460
Okay.

7380
07:25:49,920 --> 07:25:50,700
Get inside.

7381
07:25:58,860 --> 07:25:59,580
Time for bed.

7382
07:26:01,920 --> 07:26:04,320
I don't know if I like this setup here with the couch there.

7383
07:26:04,540 --> 07:26:06,800
I liked it better when the couch was near that window.

7384
07:26:09,040 --> 07:26:11,380
I think Cal is full of shit with his feng shui.

7385
07:26:15,840 --> 07:26:16,540
Let's go to bed.

7386
07:26:23,580 --> 07:26:25,220
No scrolling for you.

7387
07:26:26,300 --> 07:26:27,320
Straight sleep.

7388
07:26:44,960 --> 07:26:46,400
So today's the day.

7389
07:26:47,300 --> 07:26:48,460
Lucia's getting out.

7390
07:26:52,990 --> 07:26:53,710
Oh, here we go.

7391
07:26:55,425 --> 07:26:56,325
Hey! You out?

7392
07:26:56,425 --> 07:27:03,725
Almost. Im in processing. Should be done any minute.

7393
07:27:04,058 --> 07:27:06,258
Of course! Be there as soon as I can.

7394
07:27:06,670 --> 07:27:06,970
Okay.

7395
07:27:12,830 --> 07:27:13,370
Sounds good.

7396
07:27:14,230 --> 07:27:15,330
She didn't give me a time, though.

7397
07:27:16,030 --> 07:27:17,870
I'll need to pick up Lucia at the prison soon.

7398
07:27:18,050 --> 07:27:18,930
She's set to be released.

7399
07:27:19,410 --> 07:27:20,970
Yeah, let me go shower first, though.

7400
07:27:21,050 --> 07:27:21,350
Come on.

7401
07:27:28,560 --> 07:27:30,020
Let's do some scrubbing.

7402
07:27:33,320 --> 07:27:34,740
Move those hands.

7403
07:27:36,920 --> 07:27:38,280
Scrub that scalp.

7404
07:27:41,900 --> 07:27:43,140
Both arms.

7405
07:27:46,220 --> 07:27:48,440
And your tummy, I guess.

7406
07:27:49,420 --> 07:27:50,180
Good, we're done.

7407
07:27:59,180 --> 07:27:59,700
Okay.

7408
07:27:59,700 --> 07:28:01,480
Now, what should I be wearing for this?

7409
07:28:02,120 --> 07:28:03,280
Wait, what just happened there?

7410
07:28:03,940 --> 07:28:05,200
Did I just lose focus?

7411
07:28:06,500 --> 07:28:07,880
Or did I gain focus?

7412
07:28:17,060 --> 07:28:18,280
What would she enjoy?

7413
07:28:22,580 --> 07:28:25,340
Isn't that what I wore when we met?

7414
07:28:30,310 --> 07:28:32,470
I mean, what about some big shots work wear?

7415
07:28:34,250 --> 07:28:35,490
That seems fine, doesn't it?

7416
07:28:36,090 --> 07:28:37,150
Let me see what else I got.

7417
07:28:39,770 --> 07:28:41,090
Okay, that one is not too bad.

7418
07:28:43,150 --> 07:28:43,510
Bottoms.

7419
07:28:45,050 --> 07:28:45,410
Jeans.

7420
07:28:49,720 --> 07:28:50,740
Yeah, why not?

7421
07:28:52,740 --> 07:28:53,880
And some footwear.

7422
07:28:55,520 --> 07:28:56,760
I mean, boots are cool.

7423
07:28:57,000 --> 07:28:57,400
Sneakers.

7424
07:28:57,840 --> 07:28:58,600
What is a high top?

7425
07:29:00,940 --> 07:29:02,380
Oh, that's what a high top is?

7426
07:29:02,980 --> 07:29:03,780
What's a low top?

7427
07:29:05,480 --> 07:29:06,300
What's the difference?

7428
07:29:08,380 --> 07:29:09,880
I mean, the color is different.

7429
07:29:10,600 --> 07:29:11,180
Slip-ons?

7430
07:29:11,320 --> 07:29:11,920
Nah, that's too much.

7431
07:29:13,560 --> 07:29:17,420
I guess high tops... Oh, wait, is it the amount of stuff underneath the foot?

7432
07:29:18,350 --> 07:29:19,330
Low top.

7433
07:29:19,750 --> 07:29:20,550
Oh yeah, it is.

7434
07:29:20,630 --> 07:29:21,030
I see now.

7435
07:29:22,530 --> 07:29:23,510
Low tops.

7436
07:29:25,010 --> 07:29:26,250
Seems good to me.

7437
07:29:27,550 --> 07:29:29,450
And maybe some accessories.

7438
07:29:31,890 --> 07:29:33,030
Aviator square?

7439
07:29:35,210 --> 07:29:37,150
I mean, that's kind of cool.

7440
07:29:39,270 --> 07:29:40,030
Hmm.

7441
07:29:42,550 --> 07:29:43,770
Found eyewear.

7442
07:29:44,710 --> 07:29:46,350
Oh, absolutely not.

7443
07:29:46,920 --> 07:29:47,500
You know what?

7444
07:29:47,560 --> 07:29:48,520
How about no glasses?

7445
07:29:51,280 --> 07:29:52,200
Maybe a watch.

7446
07:29:55,580 --> 07:29:56,640
Nice fitness watch.

7447
07:29:58,600 --> 07:29:58,980
Jewelry.

7448
