Good.

7714
07:47:17,340 --> 07:47:19,340
I had it fixed, especially for you.

7715
07:47:25,825 --> 07:47:30,992
Hey, I dress for comfort.

7716
07:47:34,825 --> 07:47:37,408
Nice. Thanks for that.

7717
07:47:38,840 --> 07:47:39,320
Nice.

7718
07:47:40,720 --> 07:47:41,200
Okay.

7719
07:47:42,320 --> 07:47:44,720
At least Andy's not gonna come and fuck me up.

7720
07:47:48,670 --> 07:47:49,610
Your girl's out!

7721
07:47:50,825 --> 07:47:53,092
A few of the guys are going to a place near us, by the water.

7722
07:47:53,192 --> 07:47:56,858
Okay, sounds good! Been waiting to see this island paradise.

7723
07:47:57,130 --> 07:48:06,890
I gotta stay in like a half mile radius of your place, except when I'm on work detail.

7724
07:48:07,270 --> 07:48:08,550
It's like house arrest.

7725
07:48:13,308 --> 07:48:15,575
Lorena's got three other kids to look after...

7726
07:48:15,790 --> 07:48:21,010
Look, there's nothing we can do except keep our heads down and get through this shit for, like, the next nine months.

7727
07:48:21,350 --> 07:48:21,650
Yeah.

7728
07:48:22,130 --> 07:48:26,710
It sucks, but at least we can make a nice home for him and get some money in the bank, you know?

7729
07:48:27,210 --> 07:48:28,070
All right, yeah.

7730
07:48:28,790 --> 07:48:30,790
Oh, I got us to lead on a job.

7731
07:48:31,210 --> 07:48:31,610
A job?

7732
07:48:31,810 --> 07:48:32,650
I got a job.

7733
07:48:33,030 --> 07:48:34,710
You know that girl Kat I was telling you about?

7734
07:48:34,830 --> 07:48:35,570
Yeah, which one's that?

7735
07:48:35,810 --> 07:48:38,310
The pregnant chick I was inside with, the rich one.

7736
07:48:38,710 --> 07:48:40,110
Oh, yeah, what about her?

7737
07:48:40,770 --> 07:48:41,170
Well...

7738
07:48:41,160 --> 07:48:44,060
Her boyfriend is, like, loaded and might have some work.

7739
07:48:44,380 --> 07:48:46,600
She says he's connected to some connected people.

7740
07:48:47,460 --> 07:48:50,120
Well, what happened to keeping our heads down?

7741
07:48:51,140 --> 07:48:51,680
I'm good.

7742
07:48:52,080 --> 07:48:55,800
Look, every girl I knew who got out is either struggling or ended up right back inside.

7743
07:48:56,220 --> 07:48:59,320
I couldn't get a job that paid the bills before my ass was locked up.

7744
07:48:59,500 --> 07:49:01,680
What kind of job do you think I can get now, hmm?

7745
07:49:01,780 --> 07:49:03,180
You know, I can help.

7746
07:49:03,320 --> 07:49:04,220
But look, not Cat.

7747
07:49:04,400 --> 07:49:05,040
Cat's different.

7748
07:49:05,260 --> 07:49:07,900
She walked out of prison and, ooh, two minutes later...

7749
07:49:08,110 --> 07:49:10,310
She's like sitting on yachts and popping bottles and shit.

7750
07:49:10,770 --> 07:49:12,610
It's like she had the secret key or something.

7751
07:49:12,870 --> 07:49:13,610
I want that.

7752
07:49:13,950 --> 07:49:15,550
Yeah, she's rich.

7753
07:49:16,650 --> 07:49:20,510
But trust me, working for them is not the same thing as being them.

7754
07:49:20,870 --> 07:49:22,230
Oh, I just ran that.

7755
07:49:22,870 --> 07:49:24,190
I don't want to jump back in with all that.

7756
07:49:24,390 --> 07:49:25,810
Yeah, well, maybe I do.

7757
07:49:26,530 --> 07:49:29,090
Look, I don't want Tommy growing up like we did Jay.

7758
07:49:31,170 --> 07:49:32,450
Just give this life a shot.

7759
07:49:33,510 --> 07:49:34,150
Did you do that?

7760
07:49:34,990 --> 07:49:35,530
Mm-hmm.

7761
07:49:38,000 --> 07:49:47,700
When he says this life, like a life without crime or... Because isn't Jason doing some pretty shady shit?

7762
07:49:48,580 --> 07:49:49,800
Yeah, Cal, we're coming.

7763
07:49:50,060 --> 07:49:51,100
Drunk sex, ooh.

7764
07:49:52,380 --> 07:49:53,640
Drunk prison sex.

7765
07:49:54,420 --> 07:49:55,480
More shots.

7766
07:49:57,720 --> 07:49:59,020
I'm down for that, man.

7767
07:49:59,600 --> 07:50:00,180
Let's see here.

7768
07:50:01,820 --> 07:50:03,720
Yeah, sorry, I'm on my way.

7769
07:50:07,240 --> 07:50:07,900
I'm coming.

7770
07:50:15,460 --> 07:50:18,760
I like that he's so excited on my behalf with Lucia.

7771
07:50:19,980 --> 07:50:23,140
Either that or he's still hoping out that she has some friends.

7772
07:50:30,520 --> 07:50:31,560
Wait, the rusty anchor.

7773
07:50:32,740 --> 07:50:33,780
There's a sign for that.

7774
07:50:37,860 --> 07:50:38,840
It's just up here.

7775
07:50:40,320 --> 07:50:42,520
Mmm... I can smell the stale beer.

7776
07:50:56,308 --> 07:50:58,825
Kinda tucked away, huh? Cute mural.

7777
07:50:58,825 --> 07:51:01,142
It's the spot next door, c'mon.

7778
07:51:03,000 --> 07:51:03,640
Okay.

7779
07:51:05,620 --> 07:51:07,000
The rusty anchor.

7780
07:51:10,392 --> 07:51:12,425
It's quite a place.

7781
07:51:12,825 --> 07:51:15,192
Don't worry, it grows on you. Beer?

7782
07:51:17,620 --> 07:51:19,080
What about some food though?

7783
07:51:19,580 --> 07:51:21,100
Actual non-prison food.

7784
07:51:21,800 --> 07:51:23,260
Shouldn't that be the first thing?

7785
07:51:24,360 --> 07:51:25,680
Come aboard!

7786
07:51:26,825 --> 07:51:29,342
Alright, I'm gonna get out of these funky-ass clothes.

7787
07:51:29,942 --> 07:51:32,975
Thanks again for picking this up.

7788
07:51:35,858 --> 07:51:36,692
Yeah.

7789
07:51:36,858 --> 07:51:39,825
Well, hmm.. my boy Alpha's got next game.

7790
07:51:39,825 --> 07:51:42,825
Then I've got the game after that.

7791
07:51:42,825 --> 07:51:44,825
Then Lopez, then Alpha again.

7792
07:51:44,825 --> 07:51:47,092
Me again. Lopez... Rabbi. Me.

7793
07:51:47,092 --> 07:51:48,692
Alright, man...

7794
07:51:53,825 --> 07:51:55,108
Whatever.

7795
07:51:55,200 --> 07:51:56,960
Who are these assholes?

7796
07:51:58,975 --> 07:52:00,675
Hey, let someone else use the table, huh?

7797
07:52:00,825 --> 07:52:02,042
Back off, man.

7798
07:52:03,660 --> 07:52:04,740
Okay.

7799
07:52:05,940 --> 07:52:07,640
He's an aviator.

7800
07:52:10,425 --> 07:52:11,225
Hey,

7801
07:52:11,225 --> 07:52:12,058
Where is she, man?

7802
07:52:12,125 --> 07:52:13,858
I've been waitin' to meet this chick forever.

7803
07:52:14,158 --> 07:52:16,258
Oh, she's freshening up. You here alone?

7804
07:52:16,825 --> 07:52:18,825
Your girlfriend is out, you think I'd come alone?

7805
07:52:18,825 --> 07:52:25,825
No way, my man, we're gonna turn this into a party.

7806
07:52:29,070 --> 07:52:30,470
Ahh...

7807
07:52:32,825 --> 07:52:37,108
Hey! Ah, c'mere, I'm a hugger! [laughs]

7808
07:52:37,108 --> 07:52:38,075
It's you!

7809
07:52:38,842 --> 07:52:41,825
Yeah, so, uh, you work..

7810
07:53:00,060 --> 07:53:01,460
Oh...

7811
07:53:05,690 --> 07:53:11,770
If we can get like an airbase contract for this shit, we don't need to sell to nobody else.

7812
07:53:11,810 --> 07:53:13,470
You got a little something-something to put aside for us?

7813
07:53:13,730 --> 07:53:16,290
Hell yeah, I got y'all greedy fuckers.

7814
07:53:16,570 --> 07:53:19,190
And oh, who do we have here?

7815
07:53:19,610 --> 07:53:20,290
Hey, baby.

7816
07:53:21,270 --> 07:53:22,830
Me llamo a Donnie.

7817
07:53:23,130 --> 07:53:25,090
But you can call me a papi.

7818
07:53:25,330 --> 07:53:26,950
Oh, so you're a Donnie.

7819
07:53:27,490 --> 07:53:30,770
I guess you heard I've been getting Jason's ass paid.

7820
07:53:32,240 --> 07:53:36,600
Oh, from the sounds of it, you got lots to do, so don't let me keep you.

7821
07:53:36,960 --> 07:53:40,200
Oh, I got all the time in the world for you, darling.

7822
07:53:41,480 --> 07:53:42,800
I need some fresh air.

7823
07:53:43,160 --> 07:53:44,740
Can you bring me another pendejo?

7824
07:53:44,920 --> 07:53:45,160
Sure.

7825
07:53:45,900 --> 07:53:47,720
Good luck with your contract.

7826
07:53:48,140 --> 07:53:48,680
Thank you.

7827
07:53:51,940 --> 07:53:53,280
You kidding me with this shit?

7828
07:53:53,940 --> 07:53:56,560
Latin chicks eat my ass up.

7829
07:53:56,780 --> 07:53:58,520
Donnie, what the fuck?

7830
07:53:59,200 --> 07:53:59,520
Nothing.

7831
07:54:09,840 --> 07:54:11,660
I'm glad I didn't antagonize these guys.

7832
07:54:21,140 --> 07:54:25,240
So, um, hey, I was wondering if we could have that little combo.

7833
07:54:26,920 --> 07:54:27,460
Unsap, bro.

7834
07:54:27,620 --> 07:54:30,120
The shot was right there, off the wall, center pocket.

7835
07:54:30,380 --> 07:54:31,260
You could have said something, bro.

7836
07:54:31,360 --> 07:54:32,680
I didn't know you were fucking blind.

7837
07:54:33,000 --> 07:54:33,300
Oh, fuck you!

7838
07:54:34,380 --> 07:54:37,880
Hey, uh, so, like I was saying... Yeah, yeah, yeah, there's a market?

7839
07:54:38,500 --> 07:54:39,760
Yeah, there's a market.

7840
07:54:39,980 --> 07:54:40,820
Ah, shit.

7841
07:54:41,060 --> 07:54:41,640
I'm all out.

7842
07:54:41,720 --> 07:54:42,020
You mind?

7843
07:54:42,920 --> 07:54:43,880
Uh, sure.

7844
07:54:44,240 --> 07:54:45,220
All right, grab me a Patriot.

7845
07:54:45,340 --> 07:54:45,640
Thanks.

7846
07:54:45,820 --> 07:54:46,160
Two of them.

7847
07:54:48,780 --> 07:54:49,980
That's gonna be trouble here.

7848
07:54:50,042 --> 07:54:52,492
Two Patriots for the assholes.

7849
07:54:52,558 --> 07:54:54,892
Hey, Dorean, love of my life!

7850
07:54:55,292 --> 07:54:56,692
Two Patriots, please, sweet sugar.

7851
07:54:59,380 --> 07:55:00,320
I'll have something too.

7852
07:55:00,420 --> 07:55:01,460
I'll take a pindejo.

7853
07:55:02,560 --> 07:55:03,580
Or a pindejo?

7854
07:55:04,825 --> 07:55:09,008
Uh-huh, uh-huh. Nectar of the gods, destructor of my soul.

7855
07:55:14,610 --> 07:55:16,070
Wait, where did Cal go?

7856
07:55:17,630 --> 07:55:18,790
He went back here, didn't he?

7857
07:55:20,830 --> 07:55:22,570
Cal... oh man, look at that diving helmet.

7858
07:55:30,750 --> 07:55:32,490
There's all this stuff on the walls here.

7859
07:55:36,010 --> 07:55:37,070
Extreme fishing.

7860
07:55:39,630 --> 07:55:41,950
The lakes are calling a must answer.

7861
07:55:42,710 --> 07:55:44,730
So all the fishermen come here and drink.

7862
07:55:46,350 --> 07:55:47,130
What's this?

7863
07:56:04,160 --> 07:56:06,300
You decide which half is the fish.

7864
07:56:10,020 --> 07:56:11,540
Great white wedding?

7865
07:56:14,420 --> 07:56:17,220
Dolphin drug fiends, crooked dope dives?

7866
07:56:17,840 --> 07:56:25,440
Are the dolphins off our coast friendly fun lovers, or do their smiles hold a dark secret?

7867
07:56:35,160 --> 07:56:35,960
Hey, Cal?

7868
07:56:36,340 --> 07:56:37,240
Are you back here?

7869
07:56:38,680 --> 07:56:39,900
Oh, it says kitchen.

7870
07:56:40,080 --> 07:56:40,500
Probably not.

7871
07:56:41,500 --> 07:56:41,840
Alright.

7872
07:56:44,840 --> 07:56:46,440
Where's Lucia at, anyway?

7873
07:56:46,580 --> 07:56:46,980
Lucia.

7874
07:56:49,460 --> 07:56:50,820
I'm slurring my words, man.

7875
07:56:50,900 --> 07:56:51,920
I think I'm getting tired here.

7876
07:56:52,600 --> 07:56:53,000
Oh!

7877
07:56:54,342 --> 07:57:01,825
Who ordered an ice tea?

7878
07:57:02,392 --> 07:57:06,658
Can't complain. You know your lady friend picked a good day to get out.

7879
07:57:12,592 --> 07:57:13,758
You bet.

7880
07:57:15,370 --> 07:57:18,250
Man, there's so many conversations you can have.

7881
07:57:22,680 --> 07:57:23,880
I can talk to this guy, too.

7882
07:57:30,260 --> 07:57:34,320
Yeah, it is kind of weird that I'm just like, what's up?

7883
07:57:36,760 --> 07:57:37,080
Sorry.

7884
07:57:38,340 --> 07:57:39,180
How's it going over here?

7885
07:57:42,460 --> 07:57:43,500
Oh, hey, Dougie.

7886
07:57:43,640 --> 07:57:45,600
This my boy, Jay, right here.

7887
07:57:45,840 --> 07:57:48,740
He does some of the hauling for our little operation.

7888
07:57:49,080 --> 07:57:50,500
Baby drug runner.

7889
07:57:52,040 --> 07:57:52,680
Whoa.

7890
07:57:53,640 --> 07:57:54,140
Donnie.

7891
07:57:54,540 --> 07:57:55,640
It's all right.

7892
07:57:56,180 --> 07:57:56,880
They're cool.

7893
07:57:57,260 --> 07:57:57,980
They're cool.

7894
07:57:58,180 --> 07:58:01,640
So, uh, you're some kind of pilot, too, then?

7895
07:58:02,260 --> 07:58:04,740
No, but he's learning fast.

7896
07:58:05,640 --> 07:58:07,560
Respect, damn marauders.

7897
07:58:07,680 --> 07:58:09,380
They do not make them stupid.

7898
07:58:10,825 --> 07:58:13,358
I thought you ground pounders could only jump out of planes,

7899
07:58:13,558 --> 07:58:14,825
didn't know you could fly 'em.

7900
07:58:15,570 --> 07:58:16,410
Good one.

7901
07:58:20,710 --> 07:58:22,750
Okay, meet up with Lucia when you're ready.

7902
07:58:23,630 --> 07:58:24,470
Okay, you know what?

7903
07:58:24,810 --> 07:58:25,930
I'm gonna stop for now.

7904
07:58:27,230 --> 07:58:28,490
I'm gonna pause here.

7905
07:58:29,370 --> 07:58:30,170
Save the game.

7906
07:58:30,330 --> 07:58:31,050
Oh, I can't even.

7907
07:58:36,490 --> 07:58:38,990
I'm just gonna put the PlayStation in rest mode then.

7908
07:58:39,470 --> 07:58:42,570
Guys... I gotta go to bed.

7909
07:58:43,790 --> 07:58:45,470
I'm falling a little bit of sleep.

7910
07:58:45,830 --> 07:58:46,290
Slightly.

7911
07:58:49,180 --> 07:58:50,020
How y'all doing?

7912
07:58:52,360 --> 07:58:53,200
Oh, man.

7913
07:58:53,580 --> 07:58:54,580
This was so good.

7914
07:58:55,960 --> 07:58:58,860
I have to say, so far, I am not disappointed at all.

7915
07:58:59,060 --> 07:59:01,700
This is actually beyond my expectations.

7916
07:59:02,460 --> 07:59:04,700
Like, I was expecting something good already.

7917
07:59:05,160 --> 07:59:06,880
But this is next level.

7918
07:59:08,460 --> 07:59:09,560
What a game, man.

7919
07:59:11,440 --> 07:59:12,620
What do you think about it?

7920
07:59:17,260 --> 07:59:19,600
Thank you for showing me what this game actually is.

7921
07:59:20,380 --> 07:59:21,040
You're welcome.

7922
07:59:22,020 --> 07:59:23,100
Did it inspire you?

7923
07:59:23,640 --> 07:59:24,780
Are you excited by it?

7924
07:59:26,080 --> 07:59:28,100
They have surprisingly lived up to the hype.

7925
07:59:28,200 --> 07:59:29,800
Yeah, they have.

7926
07:59:31,720 --> 07:59:36,180
I mean, I got a little, you know, excited by the hype that everyone else had.

7927
07:59:36,340 --> 07:59:39,940
But I wasn't really that excited if it wasn't for all the people talking about it.

7928
07:59:40,780 --> 07:59:43,140
Like, I was like, okay, yeah, another GTA.

7929
07:59:43,320 --> 07:59:43,780
That sounds good.

7930
07:59:43,880 --> 07:59:44,600
I mean, I like GTA.

7931
07:59:44,910 --> 07:59:45,750
I'm down for that, right?

7932
07:59:46,590 --> 07:59:49,250
But then I got really excited by all the hype on the internet.

7933
07:59:50,050 --> 07:59:51,830
And man, it actually lived up to that.

7934
07:59:52,090 --> 07:59:52,670
That's crazy.

7935
07:59:54,670 --> 07:59:56,250
I managed to last the whole stream.

7936
07:59:56,470 --> 07:59:57,910
It's 1.44 in the morning for me.

7937
07:59:57,990 --> 07:59:58,910
This game looks so cool.

7938
07:59:59,850 --> 08:00:00,850
Are you guys going to get it?

7939
08:00:01,750 --> 08:00:05,210
After watching this or... Or nah.

7940
08:00:06,310 --> 08:00:09,030
Great game so far, but I'm surprised you haven't run into a lot of bugs.

7941
08:00:09,270 --> 08:00:09,670
Right?

7942
08:00:10,830 --> 08:00:12,830
I'm so surprised as well.

7943
08:00:13,310 --> 08:00:16,790
But I guess that's what happens when you develop a game for over a decade.

7944
08:00:17,710 --> 08:00:20,550
And you're rockstar and you have pretty much infinite money.

7945
08:00:22,290 --> 08:00:23,210
It's wild.

7946
08:00:23,410 --> 08:00:24,710
Especially for an open world game.

7947
08:00:25,490 --> 08:00:26,170
Do you love driving?

7948
08:00:26,270 --> 08:00:27,090
I do, man.

7949
08:00:27,490 --> 08:00:29,050
The driving feels so good.

7950
08:00:30,650 --> 08:00:34,130
Especially when you turn on the car and you, you know, get out of the driveway.

7951
08:00:34,710 --> 08:00:40,630
You can just feel the way the car handles on the, you know, different surfaces and stuff.

7952
08:00:40,750 --> 08:00:41,430
It feels so good.

7953
08:00:43,590 --> 08:00:46,270
I feel like the story building is different than the other GTAs.

7954
08:00:46,510 --> 08:00:47,550
Yeah, for sure.

7955
08:00:47,770 --> 08:00:48,330
And you know what?

7956
08:00:48,350 --> 08:00:49,170
I actually like it more.

7957
08:00:50,550 --> 08:00:53,190
Like, okay, the other GTAs, they're fun, right?

7958
08:00:53,570 --> 08:00:54,590
It's a silly game.

7959
08:00:55,150 --> 08:00:58,210
And most of the missions are, you know, poking fun at something.

7960
08:00:59,050 --> 08:01:05,350
It's kind of rare to have a mission that is, like, a little more serious in GTA.

7961
08:01:05,950 --> 08:01:08,330
But it feels like this game has taken a more serious...

7962
08:01:09,740 --> 08:01:10,100
Stance?

7963
08:01:10,320 --> 08:01:12,280
Like, the underlying themes are serious.

7964
08:01:12,680 --> 08:01:15,280
And the story they're trying to tell here seems like a serious one.

7965
08:01:15,700 --> 08:01:17,620
With, like, funny stuff added on top of that.

7966
08:01:19,100 --> 08:01:20,140
And I actually love that.

7967
08:01:22,560 --> 08:01:24,560
I want to play it so bad I don't have a console.

7968
08:01:24,860 --> 08:01:25,520
You know what, Harrison?

7969
08:01:25,740 --> 08:01:27,960
You're probably going to get an even better experience than me then.

7970
08:01:28,240 --> 08:01:31,280
When it finally comes out on PC... Oh, baby.

7971
08:01:33,320 --> 08:01:34,320
It's going to be so good.

7972
08:01:34,460 --> 08:01:36,780
This game in 60 FPS already is making me drool.

7973
08:01:40,600 --> 08:01:41,800
How many cars were stolen?

7974
08:01:41,940 --> 08:01:43,560
I actually did not steal any cars yet.

7975
08:01:44,480 --> 08:01:46,020
I'm kind of a good boy, you know?

7976
08:01:46,340 --> 08:01:47,280
So far, at least.

7977
08:01:47,500 --> 08:01:48,180
Maybe that'll change.

7978
08:01:51,000 --> 08:01:54,020
The lighting and atmospheric effects are, like, the best I've ever seen.

7979
08:01:54,180 --> 08:01:54,440
Right?

7980
08:01:55,380 --> 08:01:56,320
It's insane.

7981
08:01:57,920 --> 08:02:02,720
Driving around at night... The thing that blew me away, man, was, like, the street lamps.

7982
08:02:03,140 --> 08:02:07,380
When I was driving down the dark road, you know, and you pass underneath a street lamp...

7983
08:02:07,550 --> 08:02:15,910
The way the car lights up and the way the headlights from the car light up the signs ahead, you know, because they're reflective signs.

7984
08:02:15,910 --> 08:02:17,950
It looks so freaking good, man.

7985
08:02:24,020 --> 08:02:28,880
I think, honestly, the way politics and culture is in the States right now, it requires more serious commentary.

7986
08:02:29,320 --> 08:02:31,160
I think that's why they're more serious here.

7987
08:02:32,360 --> 08:02:34,420
Yeah, I actually mentioned this not too long ago.

7988
08:02:34,740 --> 08:02:39,100
Like, how are they gonna make a satire out of the world right now when it's already, like, a satire, right?

7989
08:02:40,060 --> 08:02:41,840
That grandma accident was so funny.

7990
08:02:41,940 --> 08:02:42,460
Wait, which one?

7991
08:02:42,560 --> 08:02:46,500
Are you talking about the one where she was robbing someone?

7992
08:02:48,140 --> 08:02:51,240
And then I stole her scooter and ran after her?

7993
08:02:52,520 --> 08:02:54,100
Yeah, that was freaking hilarious.

7994
08:02:54,600 --> 08:02:57,640
That's the sort of emergent gameplay that happens in Grand Theft Auto, right?

7995
08:02:59,180 --> 08:03:01,180
That's the weird ass fucked up shit.

7996
08:03:04,410 --> 08:03:05,730
Wait, she got ran over?

7997
08:03:07,590 --> 08:03:08,870
I don't even remember that.

7998
08:03:09,010 --> 08:03:13,230
I remember chasing her and then giving up on chasing her because I couldn't shoot her.

7999
08:03:14,610 --> 08:03:18,710
I was gonna shoot at the, you know, ground next to her to make her scared.

8000
08:03:18,710 --> 08:03:19,770
I wasn't actually gonna shoot her.

8001
08:03:20,790 --> 08:03:23,130
She only got off the scooter because someone bumped her off.

8002
08:03:23,430 --> 08:03:24,330
Oh, true.

8003
08:03:24,630 --> 08:03:25,230
Yeah, that's true.

8004
08:03:26,150 --> 08:03:27,330
That's so funny, actually.

8005
08:03:27,470 --> 08:03:27,890
You're right.

8006
08:03:28,230 --> 08:03:32,370
I thought you meant he got, or she got, you know, driven over.

8007
08:03:32,840 --> 08:03:33,840
At the very end there.

8008
08:03:35,900 --> 08:03:36,880
That's emergent gameplay.

8009
08:03:38,140 --> 08:03:39,580
There's no way that was scripted, right?

8010
08:03:40,500 --> 08:03:43,720
Because I chose to shoot at her and then she ran off and people panicked.

8011
08:03:44,000 --> 08:03:46,320
The car ran into her, she fell off and started running.

8012
08:03:46,520 --> 08:03:47,360
Like, that's crazy.

8013
08:03:52,600 --> 08:03:54,140
Shower with Lucia next stream.

8014
08:03:55,600 --> 08:03:56,960
I'll figure that out on my own.

8015
08:03:58,700 --> 08:04:00,300
But now you've put seats in my head.

8016
08:04:00,480 --> 08:04:00,820
Thank you.

8017
08:04:03,620 --> 08:04:05,760
No, this was just for launch, Travioli.

8018
08:04:06,160 --> 08:04:10,140
I'll be streaming at a normal... well, normal time for me.

8019
08:04:10,240 --> 08:04:12,240
So that would be more like 15 CET.

8020
08:04:16,360 --> 08:04:17,680
It's cool that you can't tell.

8021
08:04:17,820 --> 08:04:18,400
Kind of magical?

8022
08:04:18,700 --> 08:04:19,700
Yeah, for sure.

8023
08:04:21,100 --> 08:04:28,600
Man, and the cops... The system with the cops, from what I've seen so far, is a big step up from the last Grand Theft Auto.

8024
08:04:29,220 --> 08:04:36,500
The whole idea of, you know, having to change your appearance, the car, and your clothing is kind of nuts.

8025
08:04:36,500 --> 08:04:37,220
I love that.

8026
08:04:37,540 --> 08:04:40,820
I was always so disappointed with cops in the past.

8027
08:04:41,640 --> 08:04:43,620
Where, okay, you get, you know...

8028
08:04:43,680 --> 08:04:44,520
X stars.

8029
08:04:45,060 --> 08:04:47,400
And you just go outside the circle and then you're good, you know?

8030
08:04:48,580 --> 08:04:49,620
This is great, man.

8031
08:04:50,220 --> 08:04:53,880
Especially for a game that is all about, you know, well, crime.

8032
08:04:54,280 --> 08:04:55,060
And cops.

8033
08:04:55,200 --> 08:04:56,380
It's cops and robbers, right?

8034
08:04:56,440 --> 08:04:57,660
That's what Grand Theft Auto is.

8035
08:04:58,500 --> 08:05:01,680
It's great that they're focusing on these basic things.

8036
08:05:05,270 --> 08:05:07,830
I mean, Alice, the whole plan was to stream all night, right?

8037
08:05:08,690 --> 08:05:09,670
So that's why I'm still online.

8038
08:05:09,810 --> 08:05:10,610
I'm gonna go to bed now, though.

8039
08:05:12,210 --> 08:05:13,030
Don't scroll in bed.

8040
08:05:13,110 --> 08:05:13,550
No, I won't.

8041
08:05:13,630 --> 08:05:13,970
I won't.

8042
08:05:14,490 --> 08:05:15,050
I promise.

8043
08:05:15,310 --> 08:05:16,550
I don't really scroll that much.

8044
08:05:22,810 --> 08:05:25,370
Dude, we're actually all agreeing how crazy this is, right?

8045
08:05:25,950 --> 08:05:28,450
Like, this game is actually that good.

8046
08:05:29,790 --> 08:05:34,330
I was for sure expecting this to be disappointing in some ways.

8047
08:05:37,350 --> 08:05:37,790
Damn!

8048
08:05:38,590 --> 08:05:40,090
Is this a new era for gaming?

8049
08:05:40,430 --> 08:05:41,070
Or what?

8050
08:05:43,450 --> 08:05:45,050
They set the bar here, for sure.

8051
08:05:46,550 --> 08:05:54,030
Now, when this comes out on PC in 60 frames or more... Also, they're gonna make an online variant, right?

8052
08:05:56,940 --> 08:06:00,080
I wonder what that's going to be like, because I never played Grand Theft Auto V online.

8053
08:06:02,680 --> 08:06:04,520
It's just GTA, I guess so.

8054
08:06:05,880 --> 08:06:11,040
I think the only game that has come close to this level of production quality is probably The Last of Us 2.

8055
08:06:12,600 --> 08:06:24,460
And I would say The Last of Us 2 still has the better sort of cinematic moments so far, you know, with the animations and character voices and stuff like that.

8056
08:06:24,810 --> 08:06:26,430
That game was, like, a linear game.

8057
08:06:26,750 --> 08:06:28,270
This is an open-world game.

8058
08:06:28,890 --> 08:06:30,570
And that's the thing that's so mind-blowing.

8059
08:06:30,930 --> 08:06:33,650
That this is almost on the level of The Last of Us 2.

8060
08:06:33,870 --> 08:06:35,250
But, like, everywhere.

8061
08:06:36,290 --> 08:06:37,690
That is nuts, man.

8062
08:06:41,160 --> 08:06:43,080
Yeah, Cyberpunk is also close, true.

8063
08:06:45,300 --> 08:06:46,660
Also, can you answer me this?

8064
08:06:46,920 --> 08:06:49,000
Can I actually go into first-person mode in this game?

8065
08:06:50,840 --> 08:06:53,280
Because I tried a little bit and I couldn't quite figure it out.

8066
08:06:54,900 --> 08:06:56,560
Because you could in Grand Theft Auto V.

8067
08:07:02,760 --> 08:07:08,320
The mixing of gameplay and storytelling, cinematics, and prison scene was definitely on par with The Last of Us 2.

8068
08:07:09,100 --> 08:07:09,960
Yeah, maybe.

8069
08:07:10,100 --> 08:07:13,040
Maybe it's been a while since I played The Last of Us 2, you know?

8070
08:07:13,160 --> 08:07:14,260
I would have to see that again.

8071
08:07:21,320 --> 08:07:22,700
The animations in this are insane.

8072
08:07:22,780 --> 08:07:23,580
I mean, they are insane.

8073
08:07:23,800 --> 08:07:24,940
It is off the charts.

8074
08:07:25,080 --> 08:07:25,140
Good.

8075
08:07:28,200 --> 08:07:31,280
Yeah, no, the vehicles in Cyberpunk are not even close to this.

8076
08:07:31,780 --> 08:07:32,220
That's true.

8077
08:07:37,830 --> 08:07:40,050
I've only seen first-person while using the mobile.

8078
08:07:40,310 --> 08:07:41,210
Yeah, okay.

8079
08:07:41,650 --> 08:07:42,890
So maybe you cannot do it.

8080
08:07:44,870 --> 08:07:45,550
And you know what?

8081
08:07:45,550 --> 08:07:54,450
I'm actually not sad about that, because it always felt a little weird that you could go into first-person, and they made a whole game about that as well.

8082
08:07:55,430 --> 08:07:57,230
But it was never really fleshed out, you know?

8083
08:07:57,290 --> 08:08:00,310
You could tell that it wasn't as polished as third-person.

8084
08:08:00,930 --> 08:08:03,130
So I like the fact that they went for one decision.

8085
08:08:04,930 --> 08:08:07,770
Just like Cyberpunk made a decision to go first person only, right?

8086
08:08:10,070 --> 08:08:12,330
So, do one thing and do it better.

8087
08:08:12,610 --> 08:08:13,750
And do it really well.

8088
08:08:14,070 --> 08:08:14,870
That's what I meant.

8089
08:08:16,770 --> 08:08:20,290
First person on Grand Theft Auto V came later on PC.

8090
08:08:20,610 --> 08:08:22,730
Oh, yeah, that's true, actually.

8091
08:08:23,250 --> 08:08:24,650
It wasn't there on launch.

8092
08:08:25,610 --> 08:08:27,510
So it was kind of an afterthought, I guess.

8093
08:08:30,720 --> 08:08:33,480
Okay, I'm definitely gonna finish this game on stream.

8094
08:08:33,960 --> 08:08:35,460
Not right now, but over time.

8095
08:08:35,800 --> 08:08:37,120
We're gonna be playing this until the end.

8096
08:08:38,240 --> 08:08:41,140
There's no way this game suddenly takes a nosedive and becomes terrible.

8097
08:08:41,340 --> 08:08:41,920
I doubt that.

8098
08:08:42,440 --> 08:08:46,700
If this keeps up the quality that is on display right now... Dude, I'm sold.

8099
08:08:46,880 --> 08:08:47,140
Alright?

8100
08:08:48,520 --> 08:08:50,880
And yes, we're still gonna play KSP and Minecraft.

8101
08:08:51,560 --> 08:08:52,800
And some WoW as well.

8102
08:08:52,920 --> 08:08:54,700
So we're gonna play four games at the same time.

8103
08:08:55,040 --> 08:08:56,060
Lots of gaming ahead.

8104
08:08:57,610 --> 08:08:58,670
Guys, thanks for watching.

8105
08:08:58,870 --> 08:08:59,990
This was an absolute blast.

8106
08:09:01,250 --> 08:09:04,070
It's been a while since I did one of these all-nighters.

8107
08:09:04,450 --> 08:09:06,470
Well, last time was WoW forever.

8108
08:09:06,830 --> 08:09:08,630
It's kind of funny that I did two of these in a row, almost.

8109
08:09:09,230 --> 08:09:11,190
But yeah, I can feel I'm getting old, you know?

8110
08:09:12,110 --> 08:09:13,490
These all-nighters take it out of me.

8111
08:09:13,970 --> 08:09:14,670
But it was fun.

8112
08:09:15,470 --> 08:09:16,550
I will see you in the next stream.

8113
08:09:16,990 --> 08:09:22,390
Thank you all for being here, hanging out, subbing, and chatting, and just chillaxing with me.

8114
08:09:22,890 --> 08:09:24,830
Even though I didn't do much interaction with you guys.

8115
08:09:26,380 --> 08:09:27,020
I'll see you around.

8116
08:09:27,180 --> 08:09:27,400
Bye-bye.
